(178, 2159029, 'Stabilized 8-Unit Multifamily Complex near Health Corridor', 'Multifamily | 8.03% CAP | 8 Units', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>1835 Southpointe Drive is a stabilized, income-producing multifamily asset located near the Baton Rouge Health Corridor.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>Currently yielding a Net Operating Income of $57,380 and a cap rate of 8.0%.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>The property comprises (8) 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath units, each designed with functional layouts and updated interiors.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>Strategically positioned within 2 minutes of the Perkins Road and Essen Lane intersection, the property sits just outside of Baton Rouge’s expanding health corridor, with excellent access to I-10 (4 mins) and I-12 (5 mins).​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>This complex can be acquired individually or as part of a portfolio alongside 1701 Ryder Drive, a 7-unit asset just 500 ft away from the subject property.​</span></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 24, 39, 1)\"><span>Offering Memorandum </span></span></strong><a href=\"https://buildout.com/sharing/1835-southpointe-dr?file=3886375\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 24, 39, 1)\"><span>https://buildout.​com/sharing/1835-southpointe-dr?file=3886375</span></span></strong></a></p>', 715000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'louisiana-stabilized-8-unit-multifamily-complex-near-health-corridor', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2159029/louisiana-stabilized-8-unit-multifamily-complex-near-health-corridor', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2159029/2fb475f5587b452da3bc807d9ca238e3_716x444.jpg', 4, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-27 20:02:49', '2025-08-27 20:06:37', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(179, 2243933, 'Former Nursing Home Facility with Loads of Potential', '10,404 SF | 18 Units', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">Alexsis Wolfson | 949-799-4658 | aaguirre@crexi.​com</span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: bold\">.​</span></p><p>Discover endless commercial possibilities with this Former Nursing Home Facility with Loads of Potential in Bingham, ME at 43 Owens St.​ This expansive property boasts over 10,000 square feet of space and includes a main building with 18 bedrooms that can be easily transformed into office spaces, living quarters, or meeting rooms.​ The site features a large cafeteria, offices, an industrial kitchen, a salon, and storage rooms, offering a versatile layout for various uses.​ Previously a nursing home, this facility is equipped with modern amenities such as a heating system, air conditioning, sprinkler system, and high-speed internet.​ With additional office buildings, designated parking spots, and 1.31 acres of land for possible expansion, this property is primed for investment opportunities.​ The auction presents a chance to acquire this turnkey space that holds great potential for businesses or developments.​ Contact the listing agent for a private showing and secure your spot in this thriving location!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p> </p><p>43 Owens St, Bingham, ME 04920</p>', 50000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Senior Living\"]', '[]', 'maine-former-nursing-home-facility-with-loads-of-potential', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2243933/maine-former-nursing-home-facility-with-loads-of-potential', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2243933/34c01d0650b24b74911da6fd048001f0_716x444.jpg', 12, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-11-13 01:39:33', '2025-11-17 20:20:02', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(180, 2228329, 'Shoreline Drive On Lake Minnetonka', 'Multifamily | 10 Units | $160,000/unit', '<p>Offered for sale for the fist time in more than 10 years, Marcus & Millichap, as exclusive listing agent, is pleased to present Shoreline Drive.​ A boutique mixed-use asset located in the highly coveted Navarre neighborhood of Orono, Minnesota.​ Positioned just west of Lafayette Bay in Lake Minnetonka, the property benefits from one of the Twin Cities highest income areas and desirable A+ locations.​</p><p>Situated on almost one acre, the building is comprised of 5 apartment units and 5 store front retail units.​ Built in 1952, the community has been well maintained offering residential tenants 4 two-bedroom units and 1 one and a half-bedroom unit.​ The retail portion contains three spaces along Shoreline Drive, a well trafficked corridor with great visibility, with an additional two retail spaces in the back facing lake Minnetonka.​ Retail in this building ranges from 900 square feet to 1,706 square feet.​ Shore line Drive benefits from it’s position near the major intersection of Shadywood Rd and Shoreline Drive centrally located in the Lake Minnetonka area, the premier big lake area of Minnesota.​</p><p>For investors, Shoreline Drive presents a compelling opportunity to buy a rare asset with strong long-term fundamentals.​ This trophy asset is positioned for sustained rent growth, enhanced tenant demand, and durable value appreciation.​ Enhancements to unit interiors and common areas, including hallways, lobbies and landscaping, as well as the addition of other amenities, could further elevate the property’s profile and enhance the tenant experience.​</p>', 1600000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'minnesota-shoreline-drive-on-lake-minnetonka', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2228329/minnesota-shoreline-drive-on-lake-minnetonka', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2228329/822fb2986f1f448eae51cfd9a68f8ab1_716x444.jpg', 29, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-23 16:05:22', '2025-10-23 16:05:22', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(181, 1830155, 'Stone Creek Village', 'Owner-User Opportunity in a Regional Center Located on the Main Thoroughfare', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(33, 37, 41, 1)\"><span>Stone Creek Village is a highly attractive retail center/owner-user opportunity positioned directly along three major highways with daily visibility to over 34,000 vehicles.​ Adjacent to Tarpy\'s Roadhouse Restaurant, one of Monterey County\'s highest-grossing restaurants.​ Nationally recognized tenants such as Starbucks, Subway, and 7-Eleven have all reported strong sales performance following their tenancy in the trade area.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(33, 37, 41, 1)\"><span><br></span></span></p>', 7900000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-stone-creek-village', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1830155/california-stone-creek-village', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1830155/50380d0a307446009700d5e227af3362_716x444.jpg', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-14 21:06:30', '2025-09-09 21:48:41', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(182, 2012883, '850 Clarkson Avenue', 'Fully Renovated and Fully Occupied.', 'Fully Renovated Mixed-Use Property for Sale – 850 Clarkson Ave\nThis turnkey, property is an exceptional investment opportunity, delivered fully occupied for immediate cash flow.​\nResidential Units\nTotal of four modern apartments:\n(2) four-bedroom units\n(2) two-bedroom units\nEach unit equipped with its own dedicated boiler for independent heating\nAll residential tenants guaranteed by the Section 8 program, ensuring stable, government-backed rental income\nCommercial Space\nStreet-level store fronts, fully renovated\nSeparate utilities for commercial tenants\nInvestment Highlights\nProjected NOI: $257,000\nOwner pays only for water and common area electricity\nUpdated systems throughout: plumbing, electrical, and heating\nHigh rental demand in a rapidly developing neighborhood\nStrong Future Growth Potential\nThe property is located near major developments that will add over 1,000 new residential units within a 2-mile radius by 2026:\n329 Clarkson Ave (Clarkson Estates): 328 units under development – Learn more\n564 Utica Ave (Utica Crescent): 325 units planned – Learn more\nThese projects are expected to further boost local demand and long-term value.​', 3999999.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'new-york-850-clarkson-clarkson-avenue', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2012883/new-york-850-clarkson-clarkson-avenue', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2012883/feb5a12965764a24bdb1f4b707de077f_716x444.jpg', 50, 0, 0, 1, 0, '2025-07-11 10:21:34', '2025-10-16 18:31:56', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(183, 2212522, 'Walgreens | 8.50% Cap | Rent Increases | El Paso MSA', 'Limited Pharmacy Competition | One of the Highest Cap Rate Walgreens in Texas', NULL, 4200000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'texas-walgreens', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2212522/texas-walgreens', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2212522/9b9fe609472c446cbba1ae634f30aa1b_716x444.jpg', 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-14 21:51:09', '2025-10-15 21:19:51', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(184, 2234384, 'A Squared Storage', 'Established Self-Storage Facility with Recent Expansion – 211 Total Units', '<h3><strong>Property Overview</strong></h3><p>This is an exceptional opportunity to acquire an established, income-producing self-storage facility with proven performance and strong growth potential.​ The property recently completed a major expansion, adding <strong>102 new units</strong> for a total of <strong>211 units</strong>.​</p><p><strong>Phase 1</strong>, opened in <strong>August 2019</strong>, demonstrated rapid lease-up—reaching <strong>59% occupancy within six months</strong> and achieving <strong>full occupancy within one year</strong>.​ The newly completed <strong>Phase 2 expansion</strong> is poised to capture continued demand in this area.​</p><p>Located along <strong>Highway 20 with 244 feet of prime frontage</strong>, the facility offers outstanding visibility, easy access, and steady traffic exposure.​ Designed for efficiency and low maintenance, the property features a mix of unit sizes and modern amenities appealing to both residential and commercial tenants.​</p><p>With a strong operational history, modern technology systems, and expansion upside, this property offers investors a turnkey opportunity with stable cash flow and long-term value.​</p>', 3350000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Self Storage\"]', '[]', 'oregon-a-squared-storage', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2234384/oregon-a-squared-storage', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2234384/f8bd99bce4b74c6085dcb37704ddb96e_716x444.jpg', 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-31 22:06:55', '2025-11-03 20:05:50', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(185, 2227612, 'Wawa - Bainbridge, GA (Tallahassee FL MSA)', 'New Pricing: $4.075M Wawa in Tallahassee MSA | 20 Yr Ground Lease | Scheduled Increases', '<p><strong><u>Brand New Construction | Corporate Guaranteed (Fitch: BBB) | Scheduled Rental Increases | Options to Extend</u></strong></p><p>• The lease is corporate guaranteed by Wawa, Inc.​, an investment grade (Fitch: BBB), nationally recognized, and an established convenience store and gas brand with over 1,100+ locations</p><p>• Brand new 20-year ground lease with 6 (5-year) options to extend, demonstrating their long-term commitment to the site</p><p>• The ground lease features 5% rental increases every 5 years starting in lease year 11 and at the beginning of each option period</p><p><strong><u>Absolute NNN Ground Lease | No Landlord Responsibilities | Land Ownership</u></strong></p><p>• Tenant pays for CAM, taxes, insurance and maintains all aspects of the premises</p><p>• No landlord responsibilities</p><p>• Ideal management-free investment</p><p><strong><u>Directly Across from Walmart Supercenter | Dense Retail Corridor | Nearby Hospital | Southgate by DR Horton (42-Homes)</u></strong></p><p>• The subject property is directly across the street from a Walmart Supercenter</p><p>• The site is located in a dense retail corridor, with numerous nearby national/credit tenants including Home Depot, Tractor Supply, O’Reilly Auto Parts, Autozone, Anytime Fitness, Dollar General, and many more</p><p>• Strong tenant synergy increases consumer draw to the immediate trade area and promotes crossover store exposure to the site</p><p>• Furthermore, the asset is in close proximity to Memorial Hospital and Manor (80 beds), further increasing consumer traffic to the immediate trade area</p><p>• Brand new development by DR Horton - Southgate (42 homes) located near</p><p><strong><u>Signalized Hard Corner Intersection | Excellent Visibility | Multiple Points of Access</u></strong></p><p>• This site is located at the intersection of U.​S.​ Hwy 84 & Tallahassee Hwy which combined average 25,100 VPD</p><p>• The asset benefits from significant street frontage and multiple points of ingress/egress, providing convenience and ease for customers</p><p><strong><u>Local Demographics in 10-mile Trade Area</u></strong></p><p>• More than 24,000 residents and 8,000 employees support the trade area</p><p>• Features an average household income of $70,334</p>', 4075000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'georgia-wawa---bainbridge-ga-tallahassee-fl-msa', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2227612/georgia-wawa---bainbridge-ga-tallahassee-fl-msa', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2227612/0e6984178d914907b2387fdfefed4f02_716x444.jpg', 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-22 21:12:10', '2025-10-22 21:32:36', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(186, 1491049, 'Willow St Retail Center-Seller Finance Available', 'Willow St Value Add Shopping Center-Seller Financing', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Prime Retail Center in Long Beach on Willow St – Perfect for Owner User or Investor<br>Located in the bustling city of Long Beach, this retail center offers a fantastic opportunity for an owner user or investor.​ Situated on Willow St, this corner property boasts excellent visibility and high traffic counts, making it an ideal location for businesses looking to thrive.​<br>The property features a total of 6 units, with 2 currently vacant, offering a total building size of 3018 sq ft and a spacious lot of 10654 sq ft.​ Tenants Consist of a Smoke Shop, Ria Check Cashing, Massage/Facials, and Barbershop.​ With Popeyes as a neighboring anchor tenant, this retail center enjoys the benefits of a well-established business in the vicinity.​<br>This property is perfect for those looking to establish their own leases and create a thriving retail hub.​ Don\'t miss out on this rare opportunity to own a prime retail center in one of Long Beach\'s most sought-after locations</span></p>', 1250000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-willow-st-retail-center', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1491049/california-willow-st-retail-center', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1491049/39c2ff002277486cb3f20caff89406fd_716x444.jpg', 12, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2024-03-20 22:37:51', '2025-10-30 00:38:15', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(187, 2214860, 'I-70 Industrial Redevelopment Opportunity', '25,404 SF Building | General Business (GB) Zoning', '<div style=\"line-height: inherit; cursor: text; padding-right: 10px; color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">IN Auctioneer: Stephen Dawson, AU12500067.​</span></div><div style=\"line-height: inherit; cursor: text; padding-right: 10px; color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Crexi Technologies, AC32500016.​</span></div><div style=\"line-height: inherit; cursor: text; padding-right: 10px; color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold\"><br></span></div><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 700\">Audrey Hanna |518-625-8581| ahanna@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>Introducing a prime industrial opportunity at INTERSTATE 70 INDUSTRIAL BUILDING located at 5255 South State Road 3 in New Castle, Indiana.​ Spanning approximately 25,000 SF across 5.78 acres, this former state-of-the-art gun range offers a unique redevelopment potential directly off I-70.​ This property presents a rare chance for investors or owner/users to capitalize on its strategic location and expansive land size.​ The industrial building and surrounding acreage provide ample space for various business ventures or redevelopment projects.​ Located in a high-traffic area, this site promises visibility and accessibility for commercial activities.​ Unlock the possibilities with this exclusive listing offered by Marcus & Millichap.​ Explore the potential of INTERSTATE 70 INDUSTRIAL BUILDING as you venture into the thriving market of New Castle, Indiana.​ Contact us to schedule a viewing and discover the endless opportunities this property holds!</p><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit: Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Close of Escrow: 12/30/2025</span></strong></li></ul><p> 5255 IN-3, New Castle, IN 47362</p>', 250000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Retail\",\"Industrial\",\"Mixed Use\",\"Self Storage\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'indiana-i-70-industrial-redevelopment-opportunity', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2214860/indiana-i-70-industrial-redevelopment-opportunity', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2214860/793b2cc66b9f40b8b1636ebf89c47ec7_716x444.jpg', 28, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-27 19:41:37', '2025-11-24 22:53:49', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(188, 2200903, 'Stonecrest RV Park', '26 Units | 2 Parking Spots per Space', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Bianca Diorio | 954-302-3810 | bianca@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p>Introducing Stonecrest RV Park - an exceptional 26-unit RV park ideally situated at 14078 Business SH-288B in Angleton, TX.​ Nestled three miles south of downtown Angleton and just a short 10-mile drive to Freeport, this park offers tranquil and shaded sites, with easy access to Angleton\'s fishing and hunting reservoirs along with numerous lakes.​ Strategically located near Freeport\'s major plant expansion projects, Stonecrest RV Park presents a lucrative investment opportunity.​ The park features 25 full-service RV sites, including 24 concrete spaces, a charming single-family home, and a new amenity building waiting to be utilized.​ Monthly rates of $550, weekly rates of $175, and daily rates of $60 offer attractive income potential.​ With well water and septic sewer systems in place, along with on-site management, this park provides convenience and profitability.​ Explore Stonecrest RV Park today and seize the chance to own a thriving RV property in bustling Angleton.​ Contact our listing team to schedule a property tour!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Close of Escrow:  December 30<sup>th</sup>, 2025</span></strong></p><p> </p><p>14078 S Hwy 288b, Angleton, TX 77515</p>', 150000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Multifamily\",\"Mobile Home Park\"]', '[]', 'texas-stonecrest-rv-park', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2200903/texas-stonecrest-rv-park', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2200903/bd7e589c8ef543d786458e8b700ec306_716x444.jpg', 21, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-08 21:08:22', '2025-11-25 21:05:09', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(189, 2185629, 'Dutch Bros | Next to Culver\'s & Biscuitville Developments', '$2MM+ AUV | 37,100 VPD', '<p>SRS National Net Lease is pleased to offer the opportunity to acquire the fee simple interest (land & building ownership) in an absolute NNN leased Dutch Bros investment property located in Greenville, SC.​ The tenant, Dutch Bros, executed a 15-year lease with 3 (5-year) extension options, demonstrating their long-term commitment to this location.​ The lease features 10% rental increases every five years throughout the initial term and at the beginning of each option period, providing consistent NOI growth and a hedge against inflation.​ The lease is structured as absolute NNN with zero landlord responsibilities, making it an ideal, management-free investment opportunity for an out-of-state or passive investor.​ </p><p>The Dutch Bros Coffee is strategically positioned along N.​ Pleasantburg Drive (37,100 VPD), a highly trafficked retail corridor in Greenville.​ The property benefits from strong co-tenancy and proximity to major national retailers including Lowe’s, ALDI, The Home Depot, Hobby Lobby, Burlington, Staples, Petco, and Goodwill.​ Additionally, Dutch Bros is located near Cherrydale Point, a power center anchored by T.​J.​ Maxx, Ross, Ingles, Old Navy, Crunch Fitness, Hibbett, Pet Supermarket, and Shoe Carnival, further reinforcing the site as a retail destination.​ The site is also supported by surrounding convenience and necessity-based retailers including O’Reilly Auto Parts, The Rim Doctor, Advance Auto Parts, and Public Storage, as well as neighborhood-serving centers such as Field Plaza Shopping Center, home to The Dream Center and other community-focused uses.​ This strong mix of daily-needs retailers and established national brands ensures consistent consumer traffic and enhances the long-term stability of the location.​</p>', 2980000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'south-carolina-dutch-bros-next-to-culvers-biscuitville-developments', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2185629/south-carolina-dutch-bros-next-to-culvers-biscuitville-developments', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2185629/c81b4f0243244ef79f63cef97b52e6cb_716x444.jpg', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 19:25:23', '2025-11-18 19:25:23', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(190, 2009254, 'Applebee\'s - Atlanta (Lithonia) GA', 'Retail | 6.25% CAP | 5,241 SqFt', NULL, 4893456.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'georgia-applebees---atlanta-lithonia-ga', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2009254/georgia-applebees---atlanta-lithonia-ga', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2009254/08535d7be707467481e8f870f504faef_716x444.jpg', 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-09 17:59:45', '2025-11-11 17:07:23', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53');

