(53, 1816048, 'Spacious Skies Campgrounds Portfolio', 'Large-Scale Branded Portfolio - 15 RVP\'s across Northeast & Southeast U.S.A.', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">Colliers Manufactured Housing & RV Group</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">, serving as the exclusive agent for the Owner, presents a compelling investment opportunity for </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(28, 84, 244, 1)\">a Well-positioned branded portfolio and platform offering a strategic investment opportunity with growth potential</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">.​</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">The portfolio offering consists of 1,816 sites across 15 year-round and seasonal RV parks with significant year-over-year growth and multiple value-add opportunities.​ </span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">With an increasing focus on long-term tenancy and strong leasing momentum, </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 7, 89, 1)\">this portfolio is primed to grow both through its existing assets and with</span><span style=\"color: rgba(118, 118, 118, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 7, 89, 1)\">future acquisitions</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 62, 89, 1)\">.​</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 7, 89, 1)\">For pricing guidance, please contact Mike Nissley or Richard Knapp.​</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p></p><p><em><strong>*Do not contact park offices or its management under any circumstances.​ All property tours must be scheduled with Mike Nissley or Richard Knapp</strong></em><strong>*</strong></p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\",\"Land\"]', '[]', 'tennessee-spacious-skies-campgrounds-portfolio', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1816048/tennessee-spacious-skies-campgrounds-portfolio', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1816048/9900bd92483a408d9d1cea3ac9e7ccf5_716x444.jpg', 15, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-28 15:25:18', '2025-11-19 16:54:11', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(54, 1890226, '31 Apartment Units Fully Renovated', 'Multifamily | 31 Units | $77,419/unit | Completely Restored', '<p>Introducing a timeless investment opportunity at 1447 and 1628 Patterson Loop, Fergus Falls, MN.​ This historic property consists of two buildings, offering a total of 31 meticulously designed units.​ Originally constructed in 1920 and beau fully restored in 2017 through the Historic Tax Credit program, the buildings showcase a perfect blend of classic charm and modern convenience.​ This complete restoration, down to the bare walls, includes new roof, wiring, plumbing, tuck-pointed brick, HVAC, sprinkler system, windows, kitchen, bath, and flooring.​ The steel frame construction adds to the property\'s durability, making it a rare find in today\'s market.​ Designed by renowned architect Clarence H.​ Johnston, this property offers a rare opportunity for the astute multifamily investor to own a piece of history while enjoying the rewards of a fully modernized investment.​</p>', 2400000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'minnesota-31-apartment-units-fully-renovated', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1890226/minnesota-31-apartment-units-fully-renovated', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1890226/d878217e19bf449fbdc8152c4371a519_716x444.jpg', 23, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-04-09 17:03:08', '2025-09-12 03:29:10', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(55, 1399802, '106, 114 & 120 W 114th St', 'Multifamily | 52 Units | $119,231/unit', 'For Sale', 6200000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'new-york-106-w-114th-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1399802/new-york-106-w-114th-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1399802/e18cec6fe5574593b2b609cf482d1be3_716x444.jpg', 7, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2024-01-04 20:14:27', '2025-11-24 06:47:03', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(56, 1899238, 'WAREHOUSE FOR SALE SOMERSET COUNTY', 'Industrial | 12,200 SqFt', '<p>SHOWINGS MUST BE DONE THROUGH LISTING AGENT.​</p><p>For Sale: 12,200 SF Industrial Facility – 959 Kennedy Blvd, Manville, NJ</p><p>An exceptional opportunity to acquire a versatile 12,200 SF industrial property located at 959 Kennedy Boulevard, Manville, NJ.​ Ideal for end-users, this freestanding building is well-suited for warehousing, light manufacturing, or service-based operations.​</p><p>The facility features two oversized drive-in doors, a 17-foot clear ceiling height, and valuable outdoor storage space—a rare combination offering maximum flexibility for various industrial uses.​</p><p>Strategically situated, the property provides seamless access to major transportation routes:</p><p>4 miles to I-287</p><p>8 miles to US Route 22</p><p>10 miles to I-78</p><p>These connections offer convenient distribution logistics throughout New Jersey, New York City, and the greater Northeast corridor.​</p><p>This is a rare opportunity to purchase an adaptable industrial asset in a well-connected central New Jersey location.​</p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'new-jersey-959-kennedy-blvd-manville-nj', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1899238/new-jersey-959-kennedy-blvd-manville-nj', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1899238/b92c243fbc424283baf76c00fb7c6372_716x444.jpg', 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-04-21 15:01:19', '2025-11-03 18:39:01', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(57, 2184120, 'Mixed Use - 100% Leased', 'Restaurant with 3 Apartments | 6.53% CAP | 6,800 SqFt', '<p>Rare Mixed-Use Opportunity in the Heart of New Brunswick!</p><p>Positioned on vibrant George Street, this fully leased, income-producing mixed-use property presents a unique opportunity for investors.​ The beautifully renovated two-level restaurant space is currently leased to the popular Casa Ragazzi, offering strong street presence, steady cash flow, and a built-in tenant in one of the area’s most walkable and high-traffic locations.​</p><p>Above the commercial space are three well-maintained residential units.​ The spacious first-floor apartment features 4 bedrooms, 1 full bath, and 2 half baths, while the third floor includes two separate 2-bedroom units—all currently leased.​</p><p>Just steps from Rutgers University, public transportation, and downtown amenities, this 6,800 sqft.​ property offers a highly desirable investment profile with separate utilities, updated systems, and a reliable rent roll.​ Whether you\'re looking to expand your portfolio or secure a prime location with built-in income, this New Brunswick asset delivers.​</p>', 2600000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Mixed Use\",\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'new-jersey-mixed-use---100-leased', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2184120/new-jersey-mixed-use---100-leased', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2184120/86b2537fd9374e7c928c5c41db0b67f6_716x444.jpg', 66, 1, 1, 0, 1, '2025-09-22 17:01:27', '2025-09-22 17:02:14', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(58, 1688838, '625 Bellemeade Avenue', 'Church and Childcare Center', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Beautiful church property located in Downtown Evansville.​  This property currently houses Agape Life Church as well as Agape Christian Academy.​  The building is setup currently for both a church facility and childcare facility.​  There are 7 large classroom spaces, 2 offices, a conference room, large indoor play area and plenty of additional storage.​  There is an exiting kitchen area that is not currently being used but could be brought back up to code for a larger childcare user.​  The sanctuary space is large and features a choir loft and additional office area.​ The building has been updated with new HVAC throughout, new plumbing and updated fire and security system.​  Seller is willing to leave most childcare related items for a new owner.​</span></strong></p><p> </p>', 375000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Retail\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'indiana-625-bellemeade-avenue', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1688838/indiana-625-bellemeade-avenue', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1688838/b5fd1c7c2c1d4f749cdb030d98ee8934_716x444.jpg', 14, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2024-10-15 13:31:43', '2025-11-25 16:53:58', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
