(60, 1640364, '12 UNITS Active Turn Key Motel, FLORIDA.', 'Great Location ,high traffic ,Great potential with Pictona feild nextdoor', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(8, 8, 9, 1)\"><span>12-unit motel in Florida for sale.​ Seller carry is available US 1, in an Excellent Location Start off your 2025 investments with a bang! Excellent value, New Roof, turn-key business.​ The opportunity of a lifetime to be a motel owner with this little down and outstanding returns.​ The seller is retiring, This property includes an owner suite with a 2 bedroom apt.​</span></span></p>', 1151000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Senior Living\",\"Multifamily\",\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'florida-ranch-motel', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1640364/florida-ranch-motel', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1640364/3f10e7ae8417438788909f94b0f6f06c_716x444.jpg', 41, 1, 0, 1, 0, '2024-08-07 20:01:39', '2025-11-17 19:56:42', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(61, 1468115, '23 Frazer Avenue', 'Special Purpose | 24,103 SqFt', '<p>Existing Church with attached pre-school facility for Sale</p><p>Great location - 1/2 block from Haddon Avenue and the Collingswood Business District</p>', 1595000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'new-jersey-23-frazer-avenue', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1468115/new-jersey-23-frazer-avenue', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1468115/14717982ab5f4adfabb8a980f149b73e_716x444.jpg', 85, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2024-03-08 20:52:57', '2025-11-08 20:20:25', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(62, 2194754, '6835 Victory Dr', 'A former church, could be used as a church, day care, or other retail establishment.', '<p>6835 Victory Dr is located one block off of Bells Ferry Rd in Woodstock.​ This lies within the Bells Ferry LCI - an overlay district within Cherokee County that is attracting new community investment for live, work, play neighborhoods.​Surrounded by a large range of retail, recreation and residential development.​</p><p>A former church, this building is ideal for many commercial uses.​ It has rooms that can be used as offices, classroom/playrooms or converted into a retail center, restaurant/coffee shop - too many options to list.​ There is even an existing drive-thru with drive-thru lane.​ </p><p></p><p>Nearby:</p><p>1 block to Bells Ferry Rd</p><p>2.6 Miles to Town Lake</p><p>3.8 Miles to I-575</p><p>5.9 Miles to I-75</p><p></p><p></p>', 1900000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'georgia-6835-victory-dr', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2194754/georgia-6835-victory-dr', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2194754/95fba7b9d5a54ff78dc35e0adcd68e4a_716x444.jpg', 21, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-08 17:28:50', '2025-11-04 16:36:04', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(63, 2194006, 'Former La Coa Restaurant - 4001 N Mesa', 'Business for Sale | 3,490 SqFt', '<p>Discover an exceptional opportunity to own an</p><p>existing restaurant located at 4001 N.​ Mesa St.​, one of</p><p>El Paso’s most sought-after areas.​ Perfectly</p><p>positioned near the University of Texas at El Paso</p><p>(UTEP) and the Hospitals of Providence, this property</p><p>sits on a high traffic area and has excellent visibility,</p><p>making it a great opportunity for any restaurateur</p><p>seeking to open in an established area.​</p><p>The surrounding area is filled with commercial</p><p>developments, providing a steady influx of traffic.​</p><p>With ample parking available, guests will enjoy</p><p>convenient and easy access to the restaurant.​</p><p>This sale includes all Furniture, Fixtures, and</p><p>Equipment (FF&E), providing you with the essential</p><p>tools to seamlessly continue operations from day one.​</p><p>Prospective buyers will need to assume the existing</p><p>lease, which will reduce the complexities of starting</p><p>from new.​</p><p>For inquiries and to schedule a viewing, please</p><p>contact us today!</p>', 200000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Business for Sale\"]', '[]', 'texas-former-la-coas-restaurant---4001-n-mesa', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2194006/texas-former-la-coas-restaurant---4001-n-mesa', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2194006/370eeed53a6146cc8193fcb0750c9790_716x444.jpg', 10, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-01 16:43:14', '2025-11-21 19:52:15', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(64, 2072320, 'VALUE-ADD 11 Unit Building!', 'HUGE UPSIDE! // VALUE-ADD 11 Unit Building // Rents Below Market!', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><span>Incredible opportunity to purchase (11) apartments on Cleveland\'s east side and in the path of progress! This value-add deal is perfect for the investor looking to force significant appreciation and take advantage of a blossoming area on Cleveland\'s east side.​ Located directly next door to one of the most vibrant suburbs in Cleveland, Shaker Heights, this property is the perfect opportunity to create significant cash flow and grow your equity over time as investment in the area continues.​ The building is a solid brick build with its own parking lot for tenants.​ Currently, the owner has kept rents EXTREMELY low, presenting a major opportunity for immediate upside.​ All units are 1 bedroom, 1 bathroom and out of the (11) units, there are (8) currently occupied at $375 per month with all tenants on 6 month leases.​ The (3) vacant units will require rehab, but can immediately be leased at proforma rents of $700+ private pay - OR - lease units to section 8 tenants as CMHA 2025 payment standards for a one bedroom in this zip code are $1,128! A Savvy investor can easily get this property bringing in over $9,000+ per month! At an 8% cap rate upon stabilization, the value of this property should approach $900,000+! In addition to rent premiums, there is an opportunity to add on-site laundry for extra income (laundry room exists, but needs equipment) and charge for parking.​ Currently tenants pay electricity and cooking / heating gas.​ Owner pays water/sewer, trash, common area electric and gas for the hot water tank.​</span></span></strong></p>', 425000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'ohio-value-add-11-unit-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2072320/ohio-value-add-11-unit-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2072320/3a8eda9ba93c48ed9e6f18674aa8dbf0_716x444.jpg', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-31 14:27:54', '2025-09-14 14:35:14', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(65, 1890860, 'Lufkin Self Storage', 'Self Storage | 121 Units', '<p>Lufkin Self Storage is located in Lufkin, Texas, the\ncounty seat and largest city of Angelina County.​</p><p>The property features a total of 121 non-climate\nunits encompassing 17,100 NRSF.​ There is also one\nuncovered parking space.​ The facility has a square\nfootage occupancy of 51% and is being remotely\nmanaged by the owner.​ Construction highlights include concrete drives and perimeter fencing.​</p><p>The property has frontage on TX-94 and is under\na mile away from major retailers like Chick-fil-A,\nMcDonald’s, and Jack in the Box.​ It is also 2.1 miles\nfrom downtown Lufkin and is roughly a two-hour\ndrive from Houston or Beaumont.​</p><p>A five-mile radius around the property includes a\npopulation of 49,697 with an average household\nincome of $86,616.​</p><p>Lufkin Self Storage is being offered for sale at\n$785,000.​ </p>', 785000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Self Storage\"]', '[]', 'texas-lufkin-self-storage', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1890860/texas-lufkin-self-storage', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1890860/e506dd4429ed4ee9ac514b087ec882da_716x444.jpg', 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-04-11 14:56:56', '2025-11-19 20:33:40', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(66, 2243807, 'Minnesota Avenue Office Building', 'Owner-Occupant Investment | Minnesota Avenue Office | 8,344 SF +/-', '<p>Lloyd Commercial Real Estate presents a two-story office building with owner-occupancy or investment potential in central Sioux Falls, South Dakota.​ The property is located just south of downtown on Minnesota Avenue, which sees 30,800 VPD.​ Its visibility along a highly trafficked roadway, and convenient access to some of the city’s most popular amenities make this a strong option for a wide variety of users.​ The building features a flexible layout designed for collaboration across two well-planned levels, and includes an elevator and stairwell, connecting both floors.​ Each floor includes private offices, open work areas, break rooms, restrooms, and dedicated support spaces with ample storage.​ Exterior features include a well-maintained parking lot, monument signage, garbage enclosure, storage shed, security cameras surrounding the building, a key fob system, and existing infrastructure for a drive-up.​ With its functional layout, central location, and proximity to amenities, this property provides an ideal setting for a business looking to be near the downtown scene, with quick access to major roadways for convenient employee commutes.​</p>', 835000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\"]', '[]', 'south-dakota-minnesota-avenue-office-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2243807/south-dakota-minnesota-avenue-office-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2243807/84993602891e452cae76995c9b89c4eb_716x444.jpg', 38, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 15:38:53', '2025-11-06 16:07:45', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(67, 2159072, 'Fountain Park suite #100-C 14 separate offices', 'Office | 10.00% CAP | 4,400 SqFt', '<p>3500 Square foot professional office space.​ Could be medical, real estate, law firm, church, charitable foundation, .​ 1 large space plus 13 small and medium offices.​</p>', 795000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\"]', '[]', 'nevada-fountain-park-suite-200', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2159072/nevada-fountain-park-suite-200', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2159072/a9a5172398dd465483b71fc021f419ee_716x444.jpg', 19, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-27 21:54:34', '2025-11-21 01:01:01', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(69, 2198680, 'Former Lutheran Theological Southern Seminary Campus', 'Retail | 130,000 SqFt', '<div>CBRE  is pleased to present the rare opportunity to acquire the historic former campus of the Lutheran Theological Southern Seminary, most recently operated by Lenoir-Rhyne University.​ Situated on +17.65 acres in Columbia’s North Main Street (Noma) district, the campus offers over +130,000 square feet of existing infrastructure included in its core campus, five residential homes, and two multifamily properties.​ With historic buildings such as Beam Hall constructed in 1911, the campus combines historic architecture with modern amenities including a chapel, auditorium, library, student housing, and a recently constructed Occupational Therapy Education Facility.​ This offering presents a unique opportunity for a legacy campus in rapidly growing South Carolina.​</div><div><br></div><div><div>Founded in 1830, the former Lutheran Theological Southern Seminary operated in various cities across South Carolina before establishing a permanent campus in the Seminary Ridge neighborhood of Columbia in 1911</div></div>', 17500000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Retail\",\"Multifamily\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'south-carolina-former-lutheran-theological-southern-seminary-campus', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2198680/south-carolina-former-lutheran-theological-southern-seminary-campus', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2198680/5f511d9bfa494921aec97469dd542cfd_716x444.jpg', 57, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2025-10-08 19:39:27', '2025-10-08 19:40:49', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(70, 1718092, 'PRIME BAGLEY NEIGHBORHOOD CITY OF DETROIT GREY BOX PROPERTY', 'Retail | 3,616 SqFt', '<p>Prime Bagley neighborhood retail opportunity.​ Approximate 3600 SF building with an accompanying 8000 SF vacant parcel.​ Structure has been emptied out and is ready for renovation to commence.​ (see attached marketing package)</p>', 144000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'michigan-prime-bagley-neighborhood-location', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1718092/michigan-prime-bagley-neighborhood-location', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1718092/c0df66663d1e4120ac27c8d01c016123_716x444.jpg', 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2024-12-02 23:27:30', '2025-09-08 16:53:18', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(71, 1228047, '801 Jefferson Street', 'Multifamily | 1 Unit', '<span>One of the Most Beautiful Buildings in Klamath Falls is Looking for New Owners That Will Appreciate the History and Beauty of the Building.​ The Main Structure Was Built in 1925 and Has Had Many Upgrades to Include Electrical, Hvac, Flooring Etc.​ An Addition Was Completed in the 1960\'s Total Building 9,799 Sq.​ Ft.​ All Furniture and Equipment That is Currently in the Building Stays With the Building to Include Two Commercial Gas Ranges, Snow Blower, Tools, Maintenance Equipment, Office Equipment, Numerous Tables and Chairs, Piano, Electronics Etc.​ The Building Could Remain as a Church or Repurposed Into Many Other Uses.​</span>', 479000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'oregon-801-jefferson-street', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1228047/oregon-801-jefferson-street', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1228047/62ffe534badb42c58511cce7fec362d9_716x444.jpg', 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2023-09-13 14:09:57', '2025-11-17 17:28:09', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
