(74, 2013206, '4635 N Ocean Boulevard', 'Business for Sale | 2,131 SqFt', 'BUSINESS ONLY FOR SALE.​ SOLD AS IS\r\nSeaside Deli & Market.​ This Prime location C-Store is in the historic Boynton Beach A1A, half a mile south of Woolbright Road.​ it\'s also the only \'\'food-to-go\'\' place along A1A from Manalapan down to Delray Beach which has the potential for more profit.​ \r\nThis is a fantastic opportunity for entrepreneurs or investors looking to capitalize on a solid business model with room for expansion.​ Don\'t miss your chance to own a piece of this thriving market!', 100000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Business for Sale\"]', '[]', 'florida-4635-n-ocean-boulevard', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2013206/florida-4635-n-ocean-boulevard', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2013206/bfb94e0f95f74b95a5d89d83d69209ed_716x444.jpg', 28, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-13 11:01:23', '2025-09-30 12:03:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(75, 2179005, 'Updated 12 Unit in Old Louisville For Sale', 'Multifamily | 12 Units', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>Sale includes 110, 112, 114, 116 W.​ Oak St.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>NOW SEPARATELY METERED FOR LGE!</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>Located minutes from U of L or Downtown, this 12 unit Old Louisville property includes four 2BR/1BA units and eight 1BR/1BA units.​ The buildings have undergone major renovations and improvements, and the roof is approx.​ two years old.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>These spacious apartments include a sprinkler system and there is coin op laundry in bldgs.​ 110 and 116.​  The units are separately metered for LG&E.​  The first and second floor units each have their own HVAC systems, and the third floor units each have new mini splits.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>This is an excellent opportunity for a new owner to assume management, do some light value add, and create a stable, cash flowing asset.​</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>Deal room:</span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://connect.prgproperty.com/deal-room/247?signature=b8e7f2988359bb54e779ffd7951f709c21e45a8408753482a6dd8adfa0a1736f\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(3, 7, 18, 1)\"><span>https://connect.​prgproperty.​com/deal-room/247?signature=b8e7f2988359bb54e779ffd7951f709c21e45a8408753482a6dd8adfa0a1736f</span></span></a></p>', 1125000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'kentucky-updated-12-unit-in-old-louisville-for-sale', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2179005/kentucky-updated-12-unit-in-old-louisville-for-sale', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2179005/0089a3bf5a714d22be69e958a7051466_716x444.jpg', 25, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2025-09-16 17:23:22', '2025-10-30 15:03:14', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(76, 1733882, 'Multi-Family Redevelopment Opportunity', 'Multi-Family', '<ul><li>​<p>Unique multi-family redevelopment opportunity</p></li><li>​<p>Mid-rise three story brick apartment building with approximately 40 units</p></li><li>​<p>Architectural Gem located in active walkable neighborhood - Located at the Corner of Alter & Charlevoix St.​ Road at the Grosse Pointe Park borderline.​</p></li><li>​<p>Located in walking distance to active national retailers on Mack Avenue</p></li><li>​<p>Ideal condo conversion opportunity</p></li><li>​<p>All measurements and unit counts are estimates and need to be confirm by prospective purchaser</p></li><li>​<p>Vacant Lots highlighted in <strong><span style=\"color: rgba(182, 2, 5, 1)\">Red</span>,</strong> located at 2993, 2987, & 2981 may possibly be available for use as potential parking lot</p></li><li>​<p><em><strong>Weather permitting a self guided walkthrough will be held for potential purchasers on Jan 8, 2025 from 11:30am - 12:30pm.​ All applications to purchase shall be submitted on lone at DetroitMI.​gov/properties by 4:00pm on February 28, 2025.​</strong></em></p></li><li>​<p>Anyone entering property should dress accordingly, bring flashlight and must sign and present prior to entry the enclosed access agreement/liability waiver.​</p></li><li>​<p>Email Broker at <strong><u>Smith@summitcommercialllc.​com</u></strong> with any questions or to request additional information.​</p></li><li>​<p>All applications for purchase must be submitted at <strong>DetroitMI.​Gov/properties</strong> </p></li></ul>', 379000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Senior Living\",\"Multifamily\",\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'michigan-multi-family-redevelopment-opportunity', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1733882/michigan-multi-family-redevelopment-opportunity', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1733882/01986cde5d7a4913a723170cd914b8f0_716x444.jpg', 16, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2024-12-13 19:09:56', '2025-09-16 04:34:18', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(77, 2159036, '2412 W Wall Street', 'Retail | 6,500 SqFt', '<p>Located on Wall Street, the iconic Van Stavern Interior Design Building is now available for purchase.​ Recognized for its retro-style exterior and vibrant murals, this well-known property is a true Midland staple.​ With approximately 6,500 SF under roof, the building features a spacious, open-layout showroom ideal for retail, creative space, or office conversion.​ Formerly used as a furniture showroom, the front portion includes 1,200 SF of finished space with (3) offices, a kitchen, a restroom, and a welcoming display area.​ The rear 5,300 SF warehouse offers exceptional functionality, equipped with (2) 12-foot dock-high doors and an additional 15\' overhead door—ideal for shipping, storage, or light industrial use.​ Situated on a 0.40-acre lot, the property also offers ample space for parking or potential future expansion.​ </p>', 650000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'texas-2412-w-wall-street', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2159036/texas-2412-w-wall-street', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2159036/d362fef7258e4d1594f07fe6ee51eee4_716x444.jpg', 21, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-27 20:15:24', '2025-10-16 02:57:01', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(78, 2257585, 'Bell Liquor Market', 'Business for Sale', '<p>Bell Liquor Market is a well-established neighborhood liquor and convenience store located in a dense residential area of Livermore, California.​ The store offers a strong mix of beer, wine, spirits, tobacco, and general convenience items, supported by steady daily traffic and a loyal local customer base.​ Known for its clean layout, consistent inventory, and reliable customer service, the business operates efficiently with low overhead and simple staffing requirements—ideal for an owner-operator.​ The location provides excellent visibility, ample parking, and easy access for nearby residents.​ </p><p>The business has maintained stable sales year-round and offers multiple avenues for further growth, including expanding product offerings, enhancing marketing, and adding additional services.​ This is a turnkey opportunity to acquire a profitable, community supported retail business in a desirable East Bay market.​</p>', 350000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Business for Sale\"]', '[]', 'california-bell-liquor-market', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2257585/california-bell-liquor-market', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2257585/fea6b05968be413dad211e710301ad0b_716x444.jpg', 11, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-22 01:11:01', '2025-11-22 01:11:01', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(79, 319315, '526 Red Bush School Rd', 'Air Park Development For Sale with Income Producing Rentals', '42 Lot Airpark for sale (25 +/- 2 acre lots left & included in this sale).​ 3,100 ft asphalt airstrip.​ 12 Income Producing & Leased Hangers included.​ Clubhouse, Dining Pavilion, Outdoor fireplace and grill made from stone.​ Lake view & mountain view lots.​ 3 Gated entrances.​ Each lot will require private well and septic.​ Potential Owner Financing.​', 2500000.00, 'Call For Offers', '[\"Mixed Use\",\"Land\",\"Self Storage\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'georgia-526-red-bush-school-rd', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/319315/georgia-526-red-bush-school-rd', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/319315/95c31202bd354f37a878e1b8f4e44bd2_716x444.jpg', 20, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2020-02-27 15:40:18', '2025-09-02 16:34:40', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(80, 2037310, 'VALUE ADD Silicon Valley Multi-Family - 8.15% CAP!', 'VALUE ADD MULTIFAMILY 8.15% CAP W/ ADU POTENTIAL', '<p>This one of the highest cap rate retail/residential investments currently available in Silicon Valley.​</p><p>📍 <strong>Offered at $</strong><a href=\"3.25M\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>3.075M</strong></a><br>📈 <strong>8.15% Cap Rate</strong> on current rents<br>🏢 <strong>7 Renovated Residential Units + 2 Freestanding Retail Units</strong><br>🌳 <strong>~.50 Acre Lot</strong> with ADU development potential</p><p>Here’s what sets this property apart:</p><p>✔️ <strong>Retail Units:</strong></p><ul><li>​<p>One is a <strong>fully built-out catering kitchen</strong> with a hood, walk-in cooler & freezer— currently occupied until March 2027 featuring 4% annual increases</p></li><li>​<p>The other is a <strong>wheel & tire shop</strong> with a lease <strong>ready for renewal</strong>, providing additional <strong>value-add upside</strong> through updated terms or repositioning</p></li></ul><p>✔️ <strong>Residential Units:</strong></p><ul><li>​<p>Fully renovated with stable in-place tenants</p></li><li>​<p>Turn-key, cash-flowing from day one</p></li></ul><p>✔️ <strong>Development Potential:</strong></p><ul><li>​<p>The oversized lot makes this a perfect candidate for <strong>multiple ADUs</strong>, unlocking even more income and equity growth</p></li><li>​<p>SB79 Allows for high-density residential at this site which is ~.50 miles from the proposed Little Portugal BART Station.​</p></li></ul><p>This property is ideal for private investors looking to combine <strong>high current yield</strong> with <strong>strategic upside</strong>.​ With stabilized income, built-in value-add plays, and strong fundamentals, it checks every box for today’s savvy investor.​</p>', 3075000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'california-value-add-silicon-valley-multi-family---763-cap', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2037310/california-value-add-silicon-valley-multi-family---763-cap', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2037310/251065082bb1492d99be012b0864450b_716x444.jpg', 13, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2025-07-24 21:15:00', '2025-11-03 20:05:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(81, 873231, 'Hyatt Regency Convention Center', 'STNL Hyatt Regency Convention Ctr | 50-Yr NNN | Growing Income Stream | $9.50M | New Orleans, LA', NULL, 8500000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'louisiana-hyatt-regency-convention-center', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/873231/louisiana-hyatt-regency-convention-center', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/873231/40fb3cbf08ac40aabeb71a63d5ebf6c1_716x444.jpg', 2, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2022-08-01 21:53:48', '2025-10-10 22:03:45', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(82, 1194410, 'Sunrise MHP', 'Mobile Home Park | 8.54% CAP', '<p style=\"text-align: justify\">Sunrise Mobile Home Park is an 18 Site All Age Community located in Sierra Vista, Arizona.​ The Park was originally built in 1970 and sits on approximately 3.87 acres.​ Electric and Gas are direct billed to all tenants.​ Sixteen sites offer 60 AMP electrical service to Pedestal Units and two sites offer 100 AMP electrical service to Pedestal Units.​ The Community is on a Well Water and Septic System with (2) Tanks.​ Trash is included in the rent and paid by Owner.​ There are 5 Park Owned Homes and there are currently no Homes under Contract for Sale.​ This is a great entry level investment opportunity for a first-time investor.​</p>', 535000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Mobile Home Park\"]', '[]', 'arizona-sunrise-mhp', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1194410/arizona-sunrise-mhp', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1194410/1944f83a7aab46c49317abeccf8166f3_716x444.jpg', 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2023-07-27 18:43:33', '2025-07-31 15:43:40', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52');
INSERT INTO `properties` (`id`, `external_id`, `name`, `description`, `marketing_description`, `asking_price`, `status`, `types`, `subtypes`, `url_slug`, `external_url`, `thumbnail_url`, `number_of_images`, `has_flyer`, `has_video`, `has_virtual_tour`, `is_in_opportunity_zone`, `activated_on`, `external_updated_on`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(83, 2169006, '#1 POPULAR RIVERFRONT RV PARK IN NEW BRAUNFELS TX', 'Turn-Key 53 RV Sites + Apartment Investment in the Heart of Texas Hill Country', '<p><strong>NOTICE HEART OF TEXAS HILL COUNTRY</strong> THE LEGENDARY “RIVER RANCH RV RESORT,” A FIVE-STAR BOUTIQUE 53-SITE RV PARK, IS FOR SALE.​ NESTLED ON THE BANKS OF THE GUADALUPE RIVER IN NEW BRAUNFELS, TEXAS — “THE FASTEST GROWING CITY IN AMERICA,” RANKING SECOND FOR ITS RECORD-BREAKING POPULATION GROWTH.​ NATIONALLY ACCLAIMED AS ONE OF THE TOP TEN BEST PLACES TO LIVE & VISIT IN AMERICA BY <em>MONEY MAGAZINE</em> AND NAMED ONE OF THE “7 MOST CHARMING RIVER TOWNS IN THE ENTIRE UNITED STATES” (2024) BY <em>WORLD ATLAS</em>.​ A GOOD SAMS PARK AND RATED 5 STARS BY WOODALL.​ THE PARK BOASTS 90% OCCUPANCY YEAR-ROUND.​ THIS TURN-KEY OPPORTUNITY PROVIDES INVESTORS A BEST-IN-CLASS INVESTMENT IN ONE OF THE MOST DESIRABLE MARKETS IN THE STATE OF TEXAS.​</p><p><strong>THE GUADALUPE RIVER AT RIVER RANCH RV RESORT</strong></p><p>THE GUADALUPE RIVER AT RIVER RANCH RV RESORT CAN BE DEFINED BY ITS TOWERING BALD CYPRESS TREES, WHICH FORM A LIVING CATHEDRAL CANOPY OVER THE CLEAR WATERS FOR KAYAKERS AND TUBERS.​ THE HISTORIC ARCHED BRIDGES AND LIMESTONE BLUFFS CREATE A MYSTICAL BACKDROP ALONG THE WINDING PATH THROUGH THE TEXAS HILL COUNTRY.​</p><p><strong>PARK OVERVIEW STRUCTURES & AMENITIES</strong></p><p>THE RIVER RANCH RV RESORT STRUCTURES & FACILITIES ARE COMPRISED OF A FULL-SERVICE RV PARK WITH 53 PREMIUM LEVELED CONCRETE SITES, BOAT RAMP, SOUVENIR BAIT & TACKLE SHOP, OFFICE, ONSITE KAYAK RENTAL SERVICE, SEPARATE MEN’S & WOMEN’S RESTROOM & SHOWER FACILITIES, LAUNDROMAT W/ COIN-OPERATED WASHERS & DRYERS, CHANGE DISPENSER, DETERGENT VENDING MACHINE, LARGE APARTMENT RENTAL W/ PRIVATE BALCONY, ENTERTAINMENT PARTY DECK PAVILION, EQUIPMENT STOREROOM, DOG PARK, VOLLEYBALL COURT, CABLE TV, WIFI.​ THE PARK MAINTAINS BOOKINGS YEAR-ROUND.​</p><p><strong>PARK INFRASTRUCTURE</strong></p><p>EXPANSIVE RIVER FRONTAGE, 53 OVERSIZED CONCRETE PAD SITES W/ DOUBLE PARKING & GRASSY PICNIC AREAS, FULL HOOK-UPS WITH 20/30/50 AMP ELECTRIC SERVICE, SEWER & WATER.​ CONCRETE-PAVED ROADS WITH OVERSIZED TURNING RADII — BIG RIG FRIENDLY.​ HIGH-VISIBILITY SIGNAGE — THE SOARING SIGN CAN BE SEEN FOR MILES AND IS FAMOUS IN ITSELF.​ THE PARK IS LOCATED NEAR I-35 WITH A TRAFFIC COUNT OF OVER 150,000 VEHICLES A DAY, PROVIDING EASY ACCESS TO THE PARK.​</p><p><strong>TOTAL SITES: 53</strong></p><ul><li>​<p>GREENBELT SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE MOTORHOMES UP TO 40 FT – 12</p></li><li>​<p>RIVERFRONT SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE RIGS UP TO 50 FT – 6</p></li><li>​<p>SELECT SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE RIGS UP TO 34 FT – 12</p></li><li>​<p>PREMIUM SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE RIGS 36–50 FT – 12</p></li><li>​<p>PULL-THRU SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE RIGS UP TO 55 FT – 3</p></li><li>​<p>UNDER 20\' SITES WILL ACCOMMODATE RIGS UP TO 20 FT – 8<br><strong>ALL SITES ARE 30–35 FT WIDE</strong></p></li></ul><p><strong>SOUVENIR BAIT & TACKLE SHOP</strong><br><br></p><p>·       KAYAK RENTALS</p><p>·       FISHING TACKLE, LURES, RODS & REELS</p><p>·       BAIT (STARTING SEPTEMBER 1ST, LICENSED TO SELL LIVE BAIT)</p><p>·       OUTDOOR MERCHANDISE & APPAREL</p><p>·       ICE & CONVENIENCE GOODS</p><p>·       ATM</p><p>·       CHECK-IN COUNTER</p><p><strong>ENTERTAINMENT PARTY DECK PAVILION</strong></p><p>THE ENTERTAINMENT PARTY DECK IS AN OUTDOOR COMMUNAL GATHERING SPACE DESIGNED FOR HOSTING EVENTS — A SOCIAL HUB RESERVED FOR PARK TENANTS AND GUESTS.​ FULLY EQUIPPED WITH PLENTY OF SEATING AND LOUNGE AREAS OVERLOOKING THE WATER.​</p><p><strong>APARTMENT WITH PRIVATE BALCONY</strong></p><p>CHARMING LARGE FULLY FURNISHED STUDIO APARTMENT FEATURES LIVING AREA, DINING, FULLY EQUIPPED CHEF’S KITCHEN W/ GRANITE COUNTERTOPS, CUSTOM CABINETRY, APPLIANCES, SPACIOUS BATHROOM, AND CUSTOM-BUILT DECKED PATIO BALCONY.​</p><p><strong>THE LAUNDROMAT</strong></p><p>THE ON-SITE LAUNDROMAT OFFERS COMMERCIAL COIN-OPERATED WASHERS & DRYERS, A CHANGE MACHINE, DETERGENT VENDING MACHINE, AND A FOLDING TABLE.​</p><p><strong>LOCATION — NEW BRAUNFELS</strong></p><p>THE CITY OF NEW BRAUNFELS IS LOCATED IN THE HEART OF THE TEXAS HILL COUNTRY BETWEEN SAN ANTONIO AND AUSTIN, TEXAS.​ THE CITY HAS A THRIVING ECONOMY DUE TO ITS HIGH RATES OF POPULATION, HOUSING, AND BUSINESS GROWTH, DRIVEN BY ITS MONUMENTAL LOCATION BETWEEN SAN ANTONIO AND AUSTIN.​</p><p>TRAVELERS FROM ACROSS THE GLOBE FLOCK TO NEW BRAUNFELS.​ IT IS ONE OF THE MOST CELEBRATED RIVER TOWNS IN AMERICA, CONSISTENTLY EARNING NATIONAL AND STATE RECOGNITION:</p><p>·      FASTEST-GROWING CITY – NATIONALLY RANKED 2ND FASTEST-GROWING CITY IN AMERICA</p><p>·      DESTINATION OF THE YEAR 2024 – TEXAS TRAVEL AWARDS</p><p>·      MOST CHARMING RIVER TOWNS IN AMERICA 2024 – <em>WORLD ATLAS</em></p><p>·      TOP 10 BEST PLACES TO LIVE & VISIT IN AMERICA 2025 – <em>MONEY MAGAZINE</em></p><p>·      SCHLITTERBAHN WATERPARK – VOTED #1 WATER PARK IN THE WORLD</p><p>·      WURSTFEST – WORLD-FAMOUS OKTOBERFEST YEARLY CELEBRATION (GERMAN-STYLE SAUSAGE & OKTOBERFEST CELEBRATION)</p><p>·      GRUENE HISTORIC DISTRICT – HOME TO GRUENE HALL, THE OLDEST OPERATING DANCE HALL IN AMERICA</p><p>·      GUADALUPE & COMAL RIVERS – YEAR-ROUND TUBING, KAYAKING, PADDLEBOARDING & TROUT FISHING</p>', 3190000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'texas-riverfront-luxury-rv-park-with-onsite-office-apartment', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2169006/texas-riverfront-luxury-rv-park-with-onsite-office-apartment', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2169006/455992d455fb4e6f936ae61b6b3b1be0_716x444.jpg', 66, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-10 21:01:18', '2025-09-13 18:23:40', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(84, 2180083, '315 W 121 St - Bankruptcy Sale', 'Multifamily | 20 Units', '<p>Bid Deadline: Tuesday, December 9th, 2025 at 5:00 pm</p><p>Auction Date: Thursday, December 11th, 2025 at 2:30 PM</p><p>Sale Subject to Bankruptcy Court Approval</p><p></p><p>Property Snapshot:</p><p>• 5-story, walk-up, multifamily building in central Harlem, Manhattan</p><p>• 20 residential units across 9,715 SF</p><p>• 25 Feet of total frontage on W 121st Street</p><p>• Near the 125th Street Station (A, B, C, D trains)</p><p>• Proximity to 125th Street retail corridor: Banana Republic, Gap, Foot Locker, Chase Bank, Trader Joe’s, Marshalls and many more.​</p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'new-york-315-w-121-st---bankruptcy-sale', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2180083/new-york-315-w-121-st---bankruptcy-sale', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2180083/33a2a7067be84991ab0023c1c750d649_716x444.jpg', 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-17 17:18:52', '2025-09-17 17:18:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(85, 1649383, 'Luxury Mountain Golf Course Retreat Silverthorne Colorado', 'Exquisite Mountain Luxury Home Next to the Prestigious Raven Golf Course in Silverthorne', '<h1><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Tee Off in Luxury: Golf Course Property in Silverthorne, Colorado!</span></h1><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Nestled in the heart of the Rockies, an award-winning property offers unparalleled mountain living.​ Known for its breathtaking landscapes, pristine wilderness, and vibrant community, Silverthorne is the perfect destination for those seeking a blend of luxury and nature.​ Whether you’re an outdoor enthusiast, a golf lover, or someone looking for a serene retreat, Silverthorne has something for everyone.​</span></p><h5><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Property Highlights:</span></strong></h5><ul><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Acreage and Space</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Set on 1.54 acres, this expansive property offers 9 bedrooms and 10 baths, including 1 office/flex room, 4 full bed bunk rooms, 4 separate living/family spaces, and 2 dining rooms, sleeping </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">22 </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">persons double occupancy in custom bedding, ensuring ample space for families and guests.​</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Wine Room</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Connoisseur\'s dream, this wine room accommodates _00 bottles,</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Landscaped Grounds</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: The property boasts multiple private courtyards and balconies.​ Featuring stone courtyards, steel fire pit, custom bronze statues all surrounded by manicured plants and trees for a private oasis-in the Colorado Rockies Mountains.​ </span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Outdoor Space</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: The wrap-around decks offer prime mountain views and overlooks the 14th hole of the Raven Golf Course.​ Enjoy outdoor cooking with a built-in high-end grill and cook-top off the main kitchen.​</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">4-Car Garage</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Designed for convenience, the spacious garages provides ample room for multiple families to enjoy the property with ease.​</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Entertainment and Office Spaces</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Multiple entertainment areas and private office spaces make this home ideal for both relaxation and productivity.​ Furnishing and/or Art is negotiable and ready for your private retreats.​</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Expansive Living Area</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Main floor living with ADA room access is +</span><em><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">9,342 sq.​ ft</span></em><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">.​ of finnely finished living spaces, (6,920 sq.​ ft.​ on one level) totaling </span><em><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">10,588 sq</span></em><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">.​ ft.​ under roof.​</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Health & Safety: 3rd party inspection shows this property is in “show home shape”</span></p></li></ul><h4><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Experience Main Floor Living in Grand Style</span></strong></h4><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">This Silverthorne gem embodies fine finishes and the Western lifestyle in grand fashion.​ The main floor living design ensures that all essential spaces are easily accessible, providing a seamless and luxurious living experience.​ </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Custom Home Features</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Main Floor Primary Bedroom with Curbless Shower</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Oversized Steam Shower in West Wing</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Deck Access from Bedrooms</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Double-Sided Gas Fireplaces in Bedrooms</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• All Bedrooms are Ensuite (except one)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Built-in Bunk Room Sleeps 10</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Cabinets Throughout</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 10 Fireplaces Total:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 2 Outdoor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 5 Ensuite</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 10’ Open-Face Stone Mason Fireplace in the Great Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 8’ Mantle in Library </span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Wine and Entertainment</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 200+ Bottle Wine Room</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Multiple Wine Coolers in Kitchens with Ice Makers</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Entertainment Level with 3 TVs and Surround Sound System</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Architecture and Design</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Barrel Vault Ceiling</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Hand-Hewn Logs, Steel, and Stone Exterior Finish</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Exposed Structural Beams Throughout</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Architectural Linear Design with Views from Every Primary Room, Including All Bedrooms</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Glass Entry with Oversized Pivot Door</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Walnut Tread Floating Staircase</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Closets</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Built Walk-In Closets</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• XL Storage Closets Throughout the Home</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Flooring</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Wide Plank Alder Flooring on Main Floor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Heated Stone and Wood Inlay Flooring on Lower Level</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Floor-to-Ceiling Tile, Clay, and Facet Paint Features in most bathrooms</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Mechanical and HVAC</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• In-Floor Radiant Heat with 19 Zones</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• 3 High-Efficiency Boilers (1 dedicated to heating the driveway)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• XL Water Heater with On-Demand Water Reserve</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Fire Suppression System with Sprinkler System and Water Storage (flushed in 2024)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Two Energy Recovery Ventilation Systems (ERV)</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Exterior Finishes</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Wood, Metal, and Shingle Roof</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Robust Windsor Window Package</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Garage</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Four-Bay Garage with Epoxied Floor and Custom Storage Cabinets</span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">Smart Home Features</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Comprehensive Audio-Visual Package with Savant System Integration</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Whole-Home Sound System</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Hunter Douglass Automatic Shades on Main Floor</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Integrated Shade Valances</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(14, 14, 14, 1)\">• Custom Lighting Throughout with Lutron System</span></p>', 8390000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Hospitality\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'colorado-mountain-corporate-retreat-golf-course-silverthorne-colorado', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1649383/colorado-mountain-corporate-retreat-golf-course-silverthorne-colorado', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1649383/f68cee6f9bca4bf6be715486137d3c89_716x444.jpg', 64, 1, 0, 1, 0, '2024-08-20 22:50:04', '2025-10-14 01:10:49', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(86, 2170095, 'Gardens on Griffin', '78 Units in Leesburg', '<p>OFFERING MEMORANDUM AND FINANCIALS AVAILABLE VIA ‘See Due Diligence’ BUTTON.​</p><p>Please reach out to Jason Hague (Jason.​Hague@marcusmillichap.​com) to discuss the deal.​</p><p></p>', 13000000.00, 'Call For Offers', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'florida-gardens-on-griffin', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2170095/florida-gardens-on-griffin', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2170095/8db9c18f812542d2819fa438886d7d7e_716x444.jpg', 22, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-15 13:55:05', '2025-11-12 14:51:36', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(87, 1987854, '100 +/- Site MH/RV Park - Greater Sacramento Market', 'Seller Financing @ 5% IO I Price Reduction I 55+ Senior Park I 9% 1st Yr. COC I 20% 5 Yr. IRR', '<p style=\"text-align: center\">This 100+/- site, age-restricted MH/RV community presents a compelling opportunity to acquire a stable, income-producing asset with built-in long-term upside in Northern California’s increasingly supply-constrained housing market.​ Situated on nearly 40+/- acres, the property is operating at near-full occupancy, backed by a long-tenured 55+ resident base and a strong history of consistent collections.​</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">The community has been under long-term ownership and features a seasoned on-site manager supported by third-party oversight, offering investors a turnkey, low-touch operation with minimal staffing or oversight demands.​ The age-restricted nature of the property results in virtually no site turnover, making it especially attractive for those seeking predictable, recession-resilient cash flow.​</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">Additional value lies in the underutilized acreage, offering a clear path to future growth.​ Whether through the development of new MH or RV sites or the addition of income-generating RV or boat storage, the property offers multiple expansion avenues depending on investor strategy.​</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">Strategically located in a region experiencing chronic affordable housing shortages and growing demand for age-restricted living, the property benefits from strong demographic trends and limited competition.​ Combined with projected double-digit cash-on-cash returns by Year 5 and a high-teens IRR, this offering represents a rare chance to secure a well-positioned, yield-driven investment in a market where quality MH/RV assets are rarely brought to market.​</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">PLEASE READ BEFORE REACHING OUT OR REQUESTING MORE INFORMATION</span></strong></p><p></p><ul><li>​<p>NOTE: Before receiving any further details, location, financials, etc.​, regarding this offering, ALL prospective buyers/investors must first review the Offering Overview and execute the NDA.​</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Please visit the link below to access the Overview and NDA.​ Once completed, the signed NDA will be directly delivered to our firm’s records, prompting us to provide the full Offering Memorandum and next steps:</p><p></p></li></ul><p>👉<a href=\"https://yaleadvisors.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Yale-Teaser-Offering-04056761-1.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">https://yaleadvisors.​com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Yale-Teaser-Offering-04056761-1.​pdf</a></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center\">For preliminary questions or to connect directly after viewing the Overview & NDA, contact:</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">Dan Cook | Sr.​ Director, Pacific West Coast Director</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">+1 818-474-1031</p><p style=\"text-align: center\">dan@<a href=\"yaleadvisors.com\" target=\"_blank\">yaleadvisors.​com</a></p><p></p><p><strong>Also, please note:</strong></p><ul><li>​<p>We are NOT offering co-brokerage on this listing at this time.​</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>If you are a principal, we do not conduct deal management through Crexi.​ You will need to fill out and return the standard NDA attached at the bottom of the Overview to proceed.​</p></li></ul><p></p><p>Thank you in advance for your time and consideration!</p>', 4400000.00, 'Highest & Best', '[\"Mobile Home Park\"]', '[]', 'california-100---site-mhrv-park---greater-sacramento-market', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1987854/california-100---site-mhrv-park---greater-sacramento-market', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1987854/48aeee083c714b86a4c6faa29798b7ad_716x444.jpg', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-06-26 21:58:09', '2025-08-05 23:14:29', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(88, 1792432, '800 Michigan Street NE', 'Retail | 4,158 SF', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">First time on market; prime commercial auto shop along busy Michigan Street.​ Less than half a mile from I-196 interchange.​ Purchase could come with hoists.​ 6 OH door along Westside of building.​ Long-standing auto shop with over 40+ years in business.​ Price is for real estate only.​ Do not approach customers or employees.​ Turn-key shop ready for new ownership.​</span></p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'michigan-800-michigan-street-ne', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1792432/michigan-800-michigan-street-ne', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1792432/229b0edc15f24a1098eff535c7cd10be_716x444.jpg', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-13 15:19:03', '2025-10-06 17:23:47', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(89, 2169035, 'Commerical Building', 'Retail | 2,640 SqFt', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(33, 37, 41, 1)\"><span>As the White Mill building comes to completion in Downtown Danville and Caesar\'s Casino continues to hold its presence in the town, the opportunity to invest in infrastructure from a commercial perspective dwindles and the cost increases.​ This opportunity to own a commercial building in the downtown region of Danville comes at a time when many businesses are looking to be in the area of the city where there has been a lot of transformation.​ This building was formally a barbershop & janitorial office.​ There are 2 addresses and 2 entrances.​ This could be 2 businesses or one business could use the whole building if needed.​ Being walking distance from the White Mill building makes it very convenient to any business that may accommodate any residents in that complex.​</span></span></p>', 149900.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'virginia-commerical-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2169035/virginia-commerical-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2169035/e044766e92a84e2ba99d8561546f2fb5_716x444.jpg', 3, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2025-09-10 20:20:15', '2025-09-10 20:20:15', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(90, 2228633, 'Former Church and Sunday School', 'Special Purpose | 11,690 SqFt', NULL, 500000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'ohio-former-church-and-sunday-school', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2228633/ohio-former-church-and-sunday-school', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2228633/5c4ef6420f4f478cb52a87a9dc78e217_716x444.jpg', 10, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-23 20:07:41', '2025-10-23 20:07:41', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(91, 1688944, '3 E Church Street', 'Special Purpose | 5,667 SqFt', '<p>The beautiful church building includes 4 parcels that totals approximately 0.72 acres.​ The sanctuary portion of the property was built in the late 1800’s, with an addition put on in 1970.​ Seats approximately 100, Fully air conditioned.​ Includes a kitchen and fellowship hall all on one level.​ The building also contains two offices and multiple classrooms.​ Located in the middle of town on an intersection, off street parking available adjacent to the site as well.​ Please contact Jeff Davis or Jake Davis for more information.​ </p>', 149000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'ohio-3-e-church-street', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1688944/ohio-3-e-church-street', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1688944/e46d0e9f52f64b4dbd2d8bb7fbf665ce_716x444.jpg', 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2024-10-15 15:02:39', '2025-08-25 17:55:57', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(92, 2169424, '514 HILLGROVE Avenue 101', 'Multifamily | 12 Units', 'ONE OF TWO CONDO COMMERCIAL SPACES IN THIS NEWLY BUILT LUXURY DEVELOPMENT BUILDING.​ THESE COMPRISE THE BUILDING\'S  FIRST FLOOR, LOCATED  IN THE WESTERN SPRINGS DOWNTOWN AREA BY THE TRAIN AND LOCAL SHOPPING AREA.​ EACH COMMERCIAL SPACE HAS ITS OWN RESTROOM IN THE UNIT.​   LOCATED ABOVE ON THE 2ND,3RD, AND 4TH FLOORS ARE BEAUTIFUL RESIDENTIAL CONDOS.​ THERE IS PLENTY OF PARKING ON THE STREET AND JUST A BLOCK OR SO FROM LOCAL POPULAR RESTAURANTS.​  BUILDER WILL PAINT AND INSTALL FLOORING TO FINISH OFF THE SPACE.​ LOW INTEREST OWNER FINANCING AVAILABLE.​', 475000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'illinois-514-hillgrove-avenue-101', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2169424/illinois-514-hillgrove-avenue-101', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2169424/0f268d507cf64a9c8f24cb2136e2260b_716x444.jpg', 1, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-10 02:13:49', '2025-10-20 09:43:15', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(94, 2227431, 'Abs NNN North Carolina CVS | 303K Annual Visits (Placer.ai)', 'Retail | 8.00% CAP | 11,178 SqFt', '<p>Listed in conjunction with Brian Brockman, Bang Realty, 513.898.1551, wg@bangrealty.​com, NC DRE Lic #298998.​</p>', 3050000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'north-carolina-abs-nnn-north-carolina-cvs-303k-annual-visits-placerai', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2227431/north-carolina-abs-nnn-north-carolina-cvs-303k-annual-visits-placerai', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2227431/b08fbf0f58f64ffeb27792973e4a96d5_716x444.jpg', 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-22 18:32:17', '2025-10-29 22:27:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(95, 2184514, 'Fast Fuels - GPM Investments, LLC', 'Retail | 5.50% CAP | 6,254 SqFt', '<p>SRS National Net Lease is pleased to offer the opportunity to acquire the fee simple interest (land & building ownership) in a NN leased, GPM Investments, LLC investment property located in Grapevine, Texas.​ The tenant, GPM Southeast, LLC, recently signed a brand new, 10-year lease extension, bringing the remaining lease term 12 years with 2 (5-year) to extend, demonstrating their commitment to the site.​ The lease features 5% rental increases every 5 years throughout the initial term and at the beginning of each option period, steadily growing NOI and hedging against inflation.​ The lease is NN with limited landlord responsibilities making it an ideal, low management investment opportunity for a passive investor.​ The property recently underwent renovations valued at approximately $290,000, which included renovations to the asset’s parking areas.​ </p><p>The subject property is located near the intersection of State Highway 121 and Interstate 635 which combine to average over 261,000 vehicles passing by daily.​ State Highway 121 is the major retail and commuter thoroughfare serving the city of Grapevine.​ The asset is located approximately 1 mile from Grapevine Mills, a 1.70+ million square foot shopping mall that includes national/credit tenants such as Nike, Legoland, AMC, Neiman Marcus, Chick-fil-A, Chipotle, and many others.​ The asset is also located in the center of a primary distribution hub that includes distribution centers for companies such as Amazon, McKesson, Boeing, Lowe’s, USPS, The Container Store, and many more.​ The property is in the center of a primary retail corridor with other nearby national/credit tenants including a Bass Pro Shops, Target, Main Event, McDonald’s, In-N-Out, Olive Garden, and more, further increasing consumer traffic to the site.​ The 5-mile trade area is supported by a population of over 172,000 residents and 132,500 employees with an average household income of $161,095.​</p>', 3660000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'texas-fast-fuels---gpm-investments-llc', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2184514/texas-fast-fuels---gpm-investments-llc', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2184514/6434ff6c35ae42dbb62133b577fa8b8a_716x444.jpg', 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-22 20:48:14', '2025-09-22 20:50:12', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(96, 2140454, 'North Pointe Shopping Center', 'Retail | 5.47% CAP | 26,300 SqFt', 'Coldwell Banker Realty is pleased to present the opportunity to acquire a highly visible, income-producing retail center located on two parcels, 1747 Live Oak Boulevard and 451 Queens Avenue positioned in the heart of Yuba City, California.​\nThis well-positioned strip mall is situated on a prominent commercial corridor with strong traffic counts and excellent exposure.​ The property sits on a ± 2.27-acre parcel and offers ±26,300 square feet of gross leasable area across multiple suites, providing stable in-place income and future lease-up or repositioning upside.​\nCurrently configured with a diverse tenant mix of local and regional businesses, North Pointe Shopping Center offers a balanced combination of service-oriented and retail uses.​ Ample on-site parking, prominent signage, and multiple points of ingress and egress enhance convenience and visibility for customers and tenants alike.​ The property is zoned for commercial use, allowing a wide range of potential tenants and uses.​\nRecent improvements include upgraded HVAC systems, exterior painting, and ongoing unit renovations, ensuring minimal capital expenditures for a new owner.​ Strategically located near residential neighborhoods, schools, and other retail anchors, the property benefits from a steady consumer base and strong daytime foot traffic.​ The area continues to experience steady economic growth and population expansion, making it a compelling market for investors seeking yield, stability, and long-term appreciation.​\n1747 Live Oak Boulevard & 451 Queens Avenue represents a rare opportunity to acquire a well-maintained retail asset in a thriving Northern California submarket with value-add potential and stable cash flow.​', 3250000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-north-pointe-shopping-center', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2140454/california-north-pointe-shopping-center', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2140454/eed527382d3546a29bc117e75718fc5b_716x444.jpg', 10, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-14 12:17:23', '2025-11-04 00:20:15', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(97, 1285871, '92-Bed Assisted Living Facility - Financing Available!!!', 'Orlando, FL - 92-Bed \"Turn-Key\" Assisted Living Facility For Sale! Financing Available!!!', '<p>This is a well-established, well managed Assisted Living Facility ready for a new owner to take over and continue growing the business.​ The owners have recently expanded the facility from 74-beds to its current 92-Beds.​ The cost of the expansion was $2M.​ The income is continuing to grow every month and is reaching the $1.1M area this month (October 2023).​</p><p><strong>This facility includes:</strong></p><p>·        92-Beds/46-Units</p><p>·        20,364 SF (16,416 Rentable)</p><p>·        <a href=\"1.82-Acres\" target=\"_blank\">1.82-Acres</a></p><p>·        Built: 1987- Renovated 2022</p><p><strong>Current Financial Information (2023):</strong></p><p>·        $2,405,362 Gross Revenue</p><p>·        $955,636 NOI</p><p><strong>2024 Financial Projections (92 AL Beds – 93% Occupancy):</strong></p><p>·        $2,740,320 Gross Revenue</p><p>·        $1,121,739 NOI</p><p>·        $955,636 NOI</p><p><strong>2024 Financial Projections (32 Memory Care Reinstated):</strong></p><p>·        $3,234,720 Gross Revenue</p><p>·        $1,382,938NOI</p><p><strong>Memory Care:</strong> This facility once included a 32-unit Memory Care wing that was shut down during the construction.​ The owners will reinstate the Memory Care component at the request of the new owner, who can enjoy the additional revenue the Memory Care component will contribute.​</p><p><strong>Management: </strong>The owners of this facility are willing to offer their management services to the new owner.​  </p><p><strong>Financing: </strong>the owners have a business relationship with a reputable lender who has established lucrative financing terms for this acquisition.​</p><p></p><p><strong>Current Appraisal and Financing Information available upon request!</strong></p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Senior Living\"]', '[]', 'florida-92-bed-assisted-living-facility---financing-available', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1285871/florida-92-bed-assisted-living-facility---financing-available', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1285871/173440e8711a41ae8bfac8bf6056e07b_716x444.jpg', 9, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2023-10-09 16:15:40', '2025-10-17 17:59:12', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(98, 2197958, 'REAL ESTATE & BUSINESS FOR SALE | 309 W Broadway St', 'Real Estate & Business for Sale | 9,900 SqFt', '<ul><li>​<p>The property and business may be sold in tandem or on a standalone basis.​</p></li><li>​<p>Positioned in the flourishing Argenta Arts District, 309 W Broadway offers an exceptional office/retail setting surrounded by creativity, commerce, and culture.​</p></li><li>​<p>Spanning multiple retail bays, this property combines modern office finishes with flexible layouts ideal for professional services, tech firms, nonprofits, or creative agencies.​</p></li><li>​<p>Close proximity to high-traffic entertainment and outdoor amenities, including Argenta Plaza, Simmons Bank Arena, and the Arkansas River Trail.​</p></li><li>​<p>Enjoy nearby access to I-30 and I-40, as well as proximity to downtown Little Rock via the Main Street Bridge.​</p></li><li>​<p>Near numerous top-rated local eateries: Brood & Barley, Capeo, Skinny J’s, Four Quarter Bar, and Flyway Brewing, among others.​</p></li><li>​<p>The streetcar line — 0.1 miles away — connects the property to downtown Little Rock’s River Market and Convention Center District.​</p></li><li>​<p>Highly visible location (335’ frontage) across the street from Dickey-Stephens Park along the heavily trafficked W Broadway St, which sees 19,000 vehicles per day.​</p></li></ul>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Business for Sale\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'arkansas-real-estate-business-for-sale-309-w-broadway-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2197958/arkansas-real-estate-business-for-sale-309-w-broadway-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2197958/45560383d9424f2fa52ca2e6886343c7_716x444.jpg', 4, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2025-10-06 15:07:29', '2025-10-06 15:09:12', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(99, 1459066, 'PRIME RIDGEWOOD, FREE MARKET MIXED-USE | 7.5% CAP', 'Tax Class: 2A | USER/INVESTOR OPPORTUNITY', '<p><strong><u><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Prime</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Ridgewood</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Queens</span></span><span> Location</span></u></strong></p><ul><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>Just off busy Myrtle Avenue nearby national retailers, nearby the M subway</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>3,300 SF </span></span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Building</span></span><span> + 1,100 SF Basement & rear yard, 1 store + 2 FM apartments</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>Owner occupied property and Delivered 100% Vacant</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>Tax Class: 2A</span>, <span>Roof, Electricity renovated in 2023</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>Gross Income: $149k, Net Income: $132k (projected)</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(36, 36, 36, 1)\"><span>(</span></span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>7.5%</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>CAP</span></span><span> Rate)</span></p></li></ul>', 1759000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Mixed Use\"]', '[]', 'new-york-free-market-mixed-use-building-71-cap', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1459066/new-york-free-market-mixed-use-building-71-cap', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1459066/bc968c491fd241a7ab83a80654882d87_716x444.jpg', 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-02-25 00:58:26', '2025-11-17 02:21:09', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(100, 2258605, 'Tabor Terrace Apartments', 'FOR SALE | 24-Unit Multi-Family Investment Opportunity', '<h4><span style=\"color: rgba(33, 37, 41, 1)\"><span>Absolute Net Lease Sale | 10 Year NNN Term<br><br>Gross Land: 40,269 SF<br>Building: 3 Buildings | 19,800 SF Total<br>Unit Mix: 2 Bed, 1 Bath<br>Tenant: Warner Pacific University<br><br>Sale Price: $4,090,000 ($170,417 / Unit)<br>CAP Rate: 5.50%<br>NOI - Year 1: $225,000<br>Annual Rent Increases: 3%<br>Term: 10 Years NNN</span></span></h4>', 4090000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'oregon-tabor-terrace-apartments', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2258605/oregon-tabor-terrace-apartments', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2258605/ae11217734654e9fbbc7228a6fca8836_716x444.jpg', 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-19 22:20:36', '2025-11-19 22:20:36', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(101, 2233585, 'Postino - Corporate Abs NNN Lease - Brand New Construction', 'Corporate Abs NNN Lease | Brand New Construction | Affluent Denver MSA Location', '<p>Cushman & Wakefield is pleased to present the opportunity to acquire a premier <strong>Absolute NNN lease investment</strong> located at <strong>14588 Delaware Street in Westminster, Colorado</strong>.​ This brand-new 2025 construction is leased to <strong>Postino</strong>, a rapidly expanding restaurant brand backed by a corporate guaranty and secured with a long-term 15-year lease.​ With zero landlord responsibilities, the property offers investors a more passive income stream and long-term stability.​</p><p><strong>Postino</strong> currently operates ±34 locations across seven states, including Arizona, California, Colorado, Texas, Georgia, Tennessee, and North Carolina, and continues to grow under the leadership of <strong>Upward Projects</strong>.​ Headquartered in Phoenix, Upward Projects is a nationally recognized hospitality group with five distinct concepts spanning 40 locations.​ Their portfolio includes highly acclaimed restaurant brands such as Postino, Joyride Taco House, Federal Pizza, Windsor, and Churn.​ In 2025, Postino was ranked <strong>#28 on Nation’s Restaurant News’ “100 Under 100” list</strong>, which highlights the top emerging restaurant brands with fewer than 100 locations nationwide.​</p><p>The property is strategically positioned within <strong>The Orchard Town Center</strong>, a 155-acre open-air shopping destination anchored by Target, AMC, Macy’s, and other major national retailers.​ The site benefits from <strong>excellent visibility along Interstate 25, which sees approximately 112,276 vehicles per day</strong>, and is supported by strong surrounding demographics, with over <strong>197,000 residents within a five-mile radius</strong> and <strong>average household incomes exceeding $176,000 within three miles</strong>.​</p><p>This offering represents a rare opportunity to acquire a <strong>brand-new, long-term Absolute NNN lease asset</strong> tenanted by one of the country’s most dynamic and growing restaurant groups, located in a thriving retail corridor within the Denver metropolitan area.​</p>', 5416650.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'colorado-postino---corporate-abs-nnn-lease---brand-new-construction', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2233585/colorado-postino---corporate-abs-nnn-lease---brand-new-construction', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2233585/021126962f724b678ed721fd3682a9dd_716x444.jpg', 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-29 22:50:31', '2025-11-05 17:23:45', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(102, 1827289, '817 New Bern Ave', 'Income Producing Asset with the Ability to Increase NOI by 30% in 24 months', '<p>817 New Bern Ave Presents a Prime Investment\nOpportunity in Raleigh’s Thriving Commercial Market.​\nThis 7,211 Sf Office Building Sits Just Minutes From\nDowntown, Offering Strong Tenant Demand and\nLong-term Growth Potential.​ With Ample on-site\nParking, the Property Provides a Rare Combination of\nAccessibility and Convenience in an Area Poised for\nContinued Appreciation.​\n</p><p>This Property is Currently Configured as Eight Office\nSuites, and 10 Storage Units, and is Currently Fully\nLeased.​ All Leases Turn at the End of 2025, Providing\nan Excellent Opportunity to Re-tenant at Market\nRate.​\n</p><p>Located in One of the Fastest-growing Metros in the\nSoutheast, 817 New Bern Ave Benefits From Raleigh’s\nBooming Economy and Increasing Demand for Welllocated Office Assets.​ This is an Excellent\nOpportunity for Investors Seeking Stable Cash Flow\nWith Upside Potential.​</p>', 1695000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\"]', '[]', 'north-carolina-817-new-bern-ave', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1827289/north-carolina-817-new-bern-ave', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1827289/7f18fc48fe9c4618af0cbd456fc830e5_716x444.jpg', 16, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-12 14:25:28', '2025-11-15 15:24:05', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(103, 1467565, 'FREE MARKET MIXED USE | 8.6% CAP', 'PRIME RIDGEWOOD | TAX CLASS: 2A', '<p><strong><u><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Prime</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Ridgewood</span></span><span>, </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Queens</span></span><span> Location | </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Tax</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Class</span></span><span>: </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>2A</span></span><span> | 8.6% </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>CAP</span></span></u></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·         </span></span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>2-story</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Mixed</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Use</span></span><span> building with 2 </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Free</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Market</span></span><span> Apartments + 1 Office + 1 Store</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·         4,400 SF</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·         Triangle shaped property with frontage on all sides</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·          Apartments delivered vacant</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·          </span></span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Tax</span></span><span> </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>Class</span></span><span>: </span><span style=\"color: inherit\"><span>2A</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(66, 66, 66, 1)\"><span>·           Store was leased for 10 years in 7/2022 with 3% increase/year </span></span></p>', 1999000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Mixed Use\"]', '[]', 'new-york-free-market-mixed-use-8-cap', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1467565/new-york-free-market-mixed-use-8-cap', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1467565/61e557e9011a410db91947b5a40bc3f1_716x444.jpg', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-03-08 04:20:49', '2025-10-21 14:50:31', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(104, 2186513, 'Marshall Townhomes', '12-Unit Townhomes | Attractive Assumable Debt Terms - Term: 6.50 Years Remaining | Rate: 3.73%', '<p>Marcus & Millichap is pleased to announce the exclusive listing of Marshall Townhomes, comprised of 12-townhome units located within the Summit Hill Neighborhood of Saint Paul, Minnesota.​ 708-730 Marshall Avenue is being offered for sale on a free-and-clear basis.​</p><p>Built in 1981, Marshall Townhomes consists of one building on a 0.93-acre parcel, conveniently positioned between Downtown Saint Paul (2.5 miles) and Downtown Minneapolis (8 miles).​ The unit mix includes: one two-bedroom/one-bathroom unit at 650 square feet, seven two-bedroom/one-bathroom units at 850 square feet, two three-bedroom/one and one half-bathroom at 1725 square feet, and two four-bedroom/one and one half-bathroom units at 1980 square feet.​ Each unit is equipped with A/C wall units and individual furnaces for heating and cooling.​ Tenants benefit from the spacious unit layouts, in-unit laundry, patios, backyard space, and off-street parking.​</p><p>The property has been well maintained, with consistent improvements throughout.​ All units have been updated within the last ten years and have received continued as-needed updates as units turn.​ Since acquiring the property in 2022, the current owner has replaced nearly all appliances and has fully renovated five units.​ These updates include, but are not limited to: flooring, counter tops, cabinets, appliances, toilets, electrical fixtures, bathrooms, and vanities.​ Furthermore, all windows have been replaced since the building was built, with the current owner replacing about 30% of the windows within the last few years.​ Additionally, the roof was replaced in 2022.​</p><p>This offering presents an opportunity to acquire a stabilized asset with favorable assumable financing in place.​ Looking forward, investors can capitalize on multiple value-add strategies, including rent increases, capturing additional parking income, and continued unit upgrades.​ Furthermore, at loan maturity in 2032, the site presents significant redevelopment potential, with the ability to add as many as 75+ apartment units.​ Thanks to the lot size and existing zoning, no variances are required—allowing the next owner to bypass the planning commission process and streamline redevelopment.​</p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'minnesota-marshall-townhomes', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2186513/minnesota-marshall-townhomes', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2186513/1b830e01c6834a17b346a21972375f90_716x444.jpg', 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-24 20:46:58', '2025-10-28 19:14:48', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(105, 2093315, '1450 Merrill St, Santa Cruz', 'Multifamily | 9 Units', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(35, 31, 32, 1)\"><span>1450 Merrill St, known as “Seadowns”, is a three-building, nine-unit property that has been owned by the seller for 26 years.​ It is in close proximity to area beaches, East Cliff Drive, Pleasure Point, the Santa Cruz Small Craft Harbor, Sunday Live Oak farmer\'s market, Simpkins Swim Center and many local restaurants.​ The property contains ample outdoor space, providing a peaceful living experience for the renters.​ The property provides excellent walkability and bikeability.​ It also has 11 parking spaces, including 5 covered carport spaces.​ The coin-operated laundry is leased by the owner.​</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(35, 31, 32, 1)\"><span>The unit mix includes six 1-bedroom, 1-bath units (1-6) in the two-story building.​ Each of these six units has access to the outdoor space behind the building and has additional locked storage in the carport.​ Near the front of the property is a 2-bedroom, 1-bath unit (A) with a large fenced front yard, a 1 bedroom, 1-bath unit (B) with a fenced back yard and covered patio, and a stand-alone 2-bedroon, 1-bath unit (C).​</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(35, 31, 32, 1)\"><span>The owner has completed recent improvements including a new sewer lateral, new roof on the carport and laundry area, and fumigation for termites.​ Between turnovers, the Landlord has also painted the units, and updated appliances and fixtures, and installed new carpets.​</span></span></strong></p>', 3250000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'california-1450-merrill-st-santa-cruz', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2093315/california-1450-merrill-st-santa-cruz', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2093315/14966692a96e4d9db11e1ce3f1001d0c_716x444.jpg', 21, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-05 17:57:12', '2025-11-03 21:46:23', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(106, 2140242, '1106 Trexlertown Rd', 'Retail | 6.02% CAP | 2,101 SqFt', '<div>The Fiorentina Grill & Brick Oven Pizza is a neighborhood staple offering customers exceptional Italian food, steaks, seafood and other dining options.​</div><div><br></div><div>The current NNN lease has has an initial term going until December 31, 2029 and two subsequent 5 year renewals.​ The current lease also includes 3% or CPI, whichever is less, rental bumps every renewal term.​</div><div><br></div><div>Purchase this well built NNN property that has minimal landlord responsibilities to earn the rights to cash flow, tax benefits & equity growth in the fastest growing region in PA.​</div>', 1100000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'pennsylvania-1106-trexlertown-rd', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2140242/pennsylvania-1106-trexlertown-rd', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2140242/e868ed8fbc6049089777b5d93ba643f3_716x444.jpg', 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-15 19:41:50', '2025-09-25 18:47:18', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52');
