(165, 334774, '1510-1516 E. Division St.', 'Land | 16,000 SF', 'High traffic development site, located along the Lloyd Expressway just east of Highway 41 in Evansville, IN.​ The property is comprised of three (3) lots to be sold together.​', 100000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'indiana-15101516-e-division-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/334774/indiana-15101516-e-division-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/334774/bac476b97749412e978b082c2fa3cf65_716x444.jpg', 2, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2020-03-24 20:11:37', '2025-07-29 14:37:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(166, 2184652, 'Cash Flowing 9 Unit MHP * 10 Acres * Dade City, Pasco County', 'Mobile Home Park :: 9 units :: 10 acres :: Cash Flowing', '<p>10 +/- acre site :: Located in Dade City, Pasco County :: Sits along Old St.​ Joe Road, east of Curley Road :: Income producing, immediate cash flow :: Strong potential for development :: 9 leased mobile homes at the front of the park :: Mobile homes have been upgraded :: Tenants pay their own electric, cable and internet :: Water and lawn maintenance are included in rent :: Private setting :: Property includes 7+/- of raw land to the rear of the park :: Rear acreage can allow for custom family estate, mobile home park expansion or full‐site redevelopment :: Septic system, 7 years new :: Site is on well :: Multiple zonings include: 00AR (S1-1 and SZ2-LO, Single‐Family Rural) and 0RMH (RMHPCL2-1, Trailer Park and O-OV, RV Park) :: 5.3 miles east to Downtown Dade City :: 5.7 miles east to US Hwy 301/ Hwy 98 :: 4 miles south to State Road 52 :: 7 miles west to Interstate 75 on ramp :: 18 miles southwest to US Hwy 41 :: Ideal for income investment now and expand/ develop later :: Ideal for private home site development with income-producing property :: Please: Schedule all showings with listing agents, <strong><span style=\"color: rgba(182, 2, 5, 1)\">Do not drive or walk onto the property and Do not disturb tenants.​</span></strong></p>', 1200000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Mobile Home Park\"]', '[]', 'florida-9-unit-mhp-10-acres-dade-city-pasco-county', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2184652/florida-9-unit-mhp-10-acres-dade-city-pasco-county', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2184652/560276dd79d144a5a45b49b2d355138f_716x444.jpg', 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-23 01:10:40', '2025-10-22 22:05:40', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(167, 2186187, '5,750 SF Industrial Building', '5.69 AC | GI General Industrial District', '<p><strong>For registration requirements and regulations, please review </strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span>or contact <span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Audrey Hanna | 518-625-8581 | ahanna@</span></strong><a href=\"crexi.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">crexi.​com</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">.​</span></strong></p><p><strong>**OPEN HOUSE available on October 28 from 9am - 12pm</strong></p><p>Introducing 172 Industrial Parkway, a prime property located in Jackson, MN.​ Boasting a spacious 5,750 SF area, this versatile building features a main structure of 4,750 SF with an additional 1,000 SF dedicated to office space.​ The property sits on a generous 5.69-acre lot with a gravel/aggregate yard, offering ample space for various industrial activities.​ Built in 1990 and equipped with 16 doors, the property provides a clear height of 9’ 0” and parking for 18 tractor stalls, 22 trailer stalls, and 56 total including vehicular spaces.​ Strategically positioned, this property is ideal for businesses looking for a well-established industrial location.​ Don\'t miss this opportunity to secure a prominent address in a thriving industrial area.​ Contact us today to learn more about how 172 Industrial Parkway can elevate your business operations!</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 118, 190, 1)\">View all properties on the portfolio: </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.crexi.com/groups/bjPBJlAnKNqP741pXaxk\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(53, 118, 190, 1)\">https://www.​crexi.​com/groups/bjPBJlAnKNqP741pXaxk</span></strong></a></p><p></p><p></p><ul></ul><p></p><ul></ul><ul></ul><ul><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit: 5% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></li><li>​<span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1); font-weight: bold\">Winning Bid Amount:</span><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"> Less than $3 Million</span> |<span style=\"font-weight: bold\"> Marketing Fee:</span> 3.5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</li><li>​<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Winning Bid Amount:</span> Greater or Equal to $3 Million, But less than $5 Million | <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Marketing Fee:</span>  3.0% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</li><li>​<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Winning Bid Amount:</span> Greater or Equal to $5 Million, But less than $10 Million | <span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Marketing Fee:</span> 2.5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</li><li>​<span style=\"font-weight: bold\">Winning Bid Amount:</span> Greater or Equal to $10 Million |<span style=\"font-weight: bold\"> Marketing Fee:</span> 2.0% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></li></ul><p> 172 Industrial Pkwy, Jackson, MN 56143</p>', 50000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'minnesota-5750-sf-industrial-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2186187/minnesota-5750-sf-industrial-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2186187/56e4779275364f03bc5335bc6973d6f4_716x444.jpg', 26, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2025-10-09 21:12:52', '2025-11-24 18:36:05', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(168, 2250565, 'Family Dollar', 'Retail | 7.63% CAP | 9,173 SqFt', '<p>Investment Opportunity! This Family Dollar consists of 9,173 square feet of building space situated on 2.17 acres of land.​ The property is subject to an Absolute (NNN) lease that expires on June 30th, 2029.​ The lease provides a base rent of $101,200 annually.​ National Retailers in the area include: Chase, Subway, McDonald’s, VG\'s Grocery, and Marathon Service Station.​ High Traffic Counts with Over 9,500 Vehicles Per Day on North Genesee Road.​</p>', 1325000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'michigan-family-dollar', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2250565/michigan-family-dollar', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2250565/f1fffab3503148858a797531e6a6bfff_716x444.jpg', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-11 05:14:39', '2025-11-11 14:28:01', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(169, 2215682, 'Prime Corner Commercial Property | 0.76 Acres', 'Signalized Intersection | City Business Zoning', '<p><strong>WA Auctioneer: Auction Company License: Crexi, WA 24004486</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Alexsis Wolfson | 949-799-4658 | aaguirre@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p>Introducing an unparalleled investment opportunity at 604 Central Avenue South, QUINCY WA 98848– a prime corner commercial property in Quincy, WA, strategically positioned at the bustling intersection of Washington State Route Hwy 28 & Hwy 281.​ Boasting a 0.76-acre lot, this property features a 6,568 SF building and benefits from being a signalized location with the highest city core 2023-2024 WSDOT traffic counts.​ This sought-after locale has witnessed remarkable business growth with industry giants like Yahoo, Google, and The Boeing Company in the vicinity.​ Situated near Washington State\'s largest outdoor concert venue, The Gorge, and surrounded by major retail establishments including The Dollar Tree and McDonald’s, the property presents an ideal development opportunity for various ventures such as a pharmacy, urgent care, or hotel.​ The owner, who has held the property since the 1930s, is ready to pass on this unique estate holding in its current state.​ Don\'t miss this chance to own a piece of Quincy\'s commercial hub.​ Contact the owner\'s appointed counsel for inquiries and offers!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Close of Escrow: December 30th, 2025</span></strong></p><p>604 Central Ave S, Quincy, WA 98848</p>', 250000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'washington-prime-corner-commercial-property-076-acres', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2215682/washington-prime-corner-commercial-property-076-acres', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2215682/f2fdfd8415eb41b28960e8436c07ba6f_716x444.jpg', 29, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-30 23:48:24', '2025-11-24 18:38:17', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(170, 1757789, 'Cadence Academy - Round Rock, TX', 'Cadence Academy | Long Term NNN Corporate Lease | 6.25% Cap Rate | Austin, TX MSA', '<p>Sands Investment Group is pleased to exclusively offer for sale the 12,821 SF Cadence Academy located at 60 Limmer Loop in Round Rock, TX.​ This deal includes 12+ years remaining on a Triple Net (NNN) Lease with 2% annual escalators, providing a long-term and passive investment opportunity with a strong hedge against inflation, ensuring a stable and reliable return.​</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://signnn.com/listing-inventory/cadence-academy-nnn-asset-early-education-round-rock-tx/?utm_source=Crexi&utm_medium=Crexi-SIG&utm_campaign=Cadence_Academy_Round_Rock\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 85, 204, 1)\">LEARN MORE HERE</span></a></p>', 7022688.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'texas-cadence-academy---round-rock-tx', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1757789/texas-cadence-academy---round-rock-tx', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1757789/11f54eb92f1d40399603a3d51552de6b_716x444.jpg', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-01-29 13:51:02', '2025-10-28 21:22:22', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(171, 2193015, '3,181 SF Mixed Use Building', 'Located in the heart of Palm Beach', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span>Audrey Hanna |518-625-8581| ahanna@crexi.​com.​</strong></p><p></p><p>This jewel-box cathedral is a blend of residential and commercial space, strategically located in the trendy NORA District.​ With original stained-glass windows and a private courtyard, this property offers an intimate yet grand setting for versatile living.​ Imagine the possibilities - from a boutique co-working hub to a gourmet food hall, this space caters to a variety of creative ventures.​ Just minutes away from the Intracoastal Waterway and Palm Beach, the location is unbeatable.​ Whether you envision a wellness studio, tech workshop, or art gallery, this property is designed for the eclectic entrepreneur.​ With eight dedicated parking spaces, this property provides convenience and flexibility for your business or residential needs.​ Don\'t miss the opportunity to make this unique space your own.​</p><p>Please note property will be delivered vacant.​</p><p></p><p></p><ul></ul><p></p><ul></ul><ul></ul><ul></ul><ul><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit: Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></li><li>​<strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Close of Escrow: 12/30/2025</span></strong></li></ul><p> 816 9th St, West Palm Beach, FL 33401</p>', 150000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Mixed Use\"]', '[]', 'florida-3181-sf-mixed-use-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2193015/florida-3181-sf-mixed-use-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2193015/a8f9f70307b34c63a53aca0140ca3bba_716x444.jpg', 17, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-17 18:17:56', '2025-11-24 18:17:29', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(172, 2200467, '22 CONNOR LANE', 'Industrial | 22,000 SqFt', '<p><em><strong><u>FOR SALE — EXCEPTIONAL OWNER/USER OPPORTUNITY IN DEER PARK, NY</u></strong></em></p><p></p><p>A +/-22,000 SQUARE FOOT FREESTANDING INDUSTRIAL BUILDING SITUATED ON AN <strong><u>OVERSIZED</u></strong> +/- 1.5 ACRE PARCEL OF LAND</p><p>GREAT PRIVATE LOCATION AT THE END OF CUL-DE-SAC</p><p>FULLY FENCED IN YARD</p><p>HEAVY POWER (2500 A /408 V)</p><p>FULLY SPRINKLERED (WET) </p><p>+/- 30% OFFICE (CAN BE CONVERTED BACK TO WAREHOUSE)</p><p>FULL BUILDING GAS HVAC</p><p>1 LOADING DOCK/ DRIVE IN COMBO</p><p>15’ CLEAR CEILING HEIGHT</p><p>TOWN OF BABYLON G ZONING (LIGHT INDUSTRIAL)</p><p></p><p>MOTIVATED SELLER </p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>', 4595000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'new-york-22-connor-lane', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2200467/new-york-22-connor-lane', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2200467/5b11a8ab7da8482ba862f87e1f96cb9a_716x444.jpg', 6, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-08 16:19:24', '2025-10-27 16:25:06', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(173, 892392, '22 Units - Multifamily Investment Property For Sale', 'Multifamily Investment Property For Sale', '<p>Property Summary</p><ul><li>​<p>Address: 1415 Kinau Street, Honolulu</p></li><li>​<p>TMK: 1-2-4-10-11</p></li><li>​<p>Rental Units: 7 1BR/1BA, 2 Studios and 13 studios with shared common facilities</p></li><li>​<p>Parking: 4 Stalls</p></li><li>​<p>Zoning: BMX-3 but currently taxed as residential</p></li><li>​<p>Land Area: 8,334 sf</p></li><li>​<p>Building Area: 6,667 sf</p></li><li>​<p>Buildings: one 2-story concrete building and one 2-story wood building</p></li></ul>', 3500000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'hawaii-1415-kinau-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/892392/hawaii-1415-kinau-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/892392/a7d678e9e46a4a20b7b1ac22fa46dec7_716x444.jpg', 21, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2022-08-31 23:10:58', '2025-10-22 18:55:30', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(174, 2035368, '6% Cap Rate | 15-Year NNN | Warrenton, VA', 'Retail | 2,778 SqFt | .84 Acre', '<p><span>* New 15 year NNN lease<br>* 4 five year options<br>* 12% rent increase every 5 years<br>* $2M+ in gross rental revenue<br>* Additional percentage rent of 6% over $2.8M in gross sales<br>* Population of 26,023 within a 5 mile radius<br>* Affluent household income $137,583<br>* Layne’s Chicken Fingers is a rapidly growing franchise concept</span></p>', 2250000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'virginia-6-cap-rate-15-year-nnn-warrenton-va', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2035368/virginia-6-cap-rate-15-year-nnn-warrenton-va', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2035368/62e29c5013bc48e9823350408018a38e_716x444.jpg', 7, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-23 18:44:44', '2025-11-10 14:35:55', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(175, 1939391, '1910 McMillan - ±12,895 SF Former Daycare/ Office/ Mixed Use', 'Retail | 12,895 SqFt', '<p>NAI Charleston is pleased to present, 1910 McMillan Ave, a\n±12,895 SF former daycare located just outside of the new\nNavy Yard redevelopment project.​ The Navy Yard will consist\nof retail, office, residential, and mixed-use opportunities that\npair well with a daycare/preschool.​ Additionally, the space\nwould work well for a medical/professional office, church, or\nfinancial service institution.​ The Lowcountry Rapid Transit\nSystem is coming in 2026, offering a rapid bus system between\nCharleston, North Charleston, and Summerville.​</p><p>Location Description</p><p>Located just outside of the new Navy Yard redevelopment project in North Charleston.​</p>', 2300000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\",\"Office\",\"Mixed Use\"]', '[]', 'south-carolina-1910-mcmillan-avenue', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1939391/south-carolina-1910-mcmillan-avenue', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1939391/8b1dbed0e5164e61be56be7239a691d3_716x444.jpg', 14, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-05-28 23:44:40', '2025-11-11 20:03:21', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(176, 1751404, '10663 Montgomery Rd', 'New Sale Listing I Prime Medical Corridor I 10663 Montgomery Available I 5,885 to 17,565 Total S', 'For Sale ', 2019975.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\"]', '[]', 'ohio-10663-montgomery-rd', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1751404/ohio-10663-montgomery-rd', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1751404/01927c99918549c1a2bb121c35a3d745_716x444.jpg', 10, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-01-20 10:40:38', '2025-11-11 13:16:24', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(177, 2225420, '2.98 Acres in Bartow, FL', 'Structures on Site: Included in sale: 3 Radio towers, 715 SF office building & shed', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 700\">Hannah Ladenheim | 936-274-1332| hladenheim@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>RIPCO Investment Sales is pleased to offer for sale 1355 North Maple Avenue in Bartow, Florida.​ Situated on ±INSERT INTO `properties` (`id`, `external_id`, `name`, `description`, `marketing_description`, `asking_price`, `status`, `types`, `subtypes`, `url_slug`, `external_url`, `thumbnail_url`, `number_of_images`, `has_flyer`, `has_video`, `has_virtual_tour`, `is_in_opportunity_zone`, `activated_on`, `external_updated_on`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(191, 1828878, '3451 International Blvd, Oakland, CA', 'Value Add Property in Great location with flexible mixed use options.', '<p>This building originally served as a bank but has been a multi-tenant retail building for over 30 years, with a pawn shop occupying the 2nd floor.​ The building owner, who also owned the pawn shop, has since retired and now leases half of the 2nd floor to a new pawn shop.​ The other half of the 2nd floor has been transformed into 7 new office/retail suites, accessible by an ADA lift or stairs.​ There is also an ADA bathroom on the 2nd floor.​</p><p>On the 1st floor, Unit A is occupied by a long-standing check cashing/money transfer company.​ The former pawn shop owner is leasing back the bank vault, and 3 tenants occupy 5 suites in Unit C.​ Of the 16 parking spaces, 11 are now being leased separately, with only 5 included with suite leases.​ </p><p>This building offers significant value-add opportunities, including multi-family, commercial, or mixed-use development of the parking lot.​  An up to 7 story building with retail on the first floor and multi-family on the upper floors can be built on the currently parking lot.​ (See rendering in pictures) The property is located in am opportunity zone & a transit zone being only one block from BART and it is next door to the new housing development and the newly updated AC Transit International Blvd corridor.​</p><p>The property will stabilize this year as two of the new units and two of the parking spaces have already been leased in the first 30 days of being available.​</p><p>For additional information visit <a href=\"https://aicrepartners.com/for-sale/\" target=\"_blank\">https://aicrepartners.​com/for-sale/</a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-3451-international-blvd-oakland-ca', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1828878/california-3451-international-blvd-oakland-ca', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1828878/2cdc85543bca461d8b5f47a47fdca4bb_716x444.jpg', 14, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2025-03-13 18:12:54', '2025-11-03 21:18:08', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(192, 2246880, '1940 Bellmore Ave Bellmore NY Property & Business For Sale', 'Property & Business For Sale on a very busy Street', '<ul><li>​<p></p></li></ul><p><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>This marketing description is based on the details provided in the property investment opportunity document and public listing information.​</span></span></p><hr><p></p><h2><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>👑 Premium Restaurant & Property Investment Opportunity: The Legendary Oak Chalet</span></span></strong></h2><p></p><p></p><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>1940 Bellmore Avenue, Bellmore, NY 11710</span></span></strong></h3><p></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Asking Price: $3,800,000</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>EXCEPTIONAL COMMERCIAL REAL ESTATE ACQUISITION.​</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> Coldwell Banker Commercial AMH proudly presents a turnkey investment opportunity featuring </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>The Oak Chalet</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>, an established restaurant boasting a remarkable </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>43 years of continuous ownership and operational excellence</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>.​ This legacy property provides immediate profitability, strong brand recognition, and significant development potential in a thriving Nassau County market.​</span></span></p><p></p><h3><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Key Investment Highlights</span></span></strong></h3><p></p><ul><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Proven Longevity & Brand:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> The establishment\'s four decades of success demonstrate a loyal customer base and business practices built to weather economic cycles.​</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Strong Financial Performance:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> The property showcases robust sales, with an annual Total Income of </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>$1.23 Million</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> and a Net Operating Income (NOI) of </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>$287K</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>, reflecting efficient, well-controlled operational costs.​</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Substantial Real Estate Footprint:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> Situated on a generous </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>44,963 Sq.​ Ft.​ (1.03 Acre) lot</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>, the offering includes a spacious </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>12,000 Sq.​ Ft.​ building</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> optimized for high-volume restaurant operations.​</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Turnkey Facilities:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> The building features thoughtfully designed dining spaces, a high-volume, professional-grade commercial kitchen, and a value-added, </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>on-site bakery operation</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> with specialized equipment.​</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Excellent Curb Appeal & Access:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> The property is well-maintained with prominent signage, professional landscaping, and offers </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>60 dedicated parking spots</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> for high customer traffic volume.​</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>Cash Flow Generator:</span></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span> The financial structure demonstrates healthy margins and strong cash flow generation capabilities for future investors.​</span></span></p></li></ul><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(27, 28, 29, 1)\"><span>This is a rare opportunity to acquire a profitable, single-unit establishment with an established community presence and solid foundation for continued growth and future profitability.​</span></span></strong></p>', 3800000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Business for Sale\",\"Land\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'new-york-1940-bellmore-ave-bellmore-ny-property-business-for-sale', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2246880/new-york-1940-bellmore-ave-bellmore-ny-property-business-for-sale', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2246880/4a9efaaa79c14d57af258a5f03d93166_716x444.jpg', 25, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-06 20:15:31', '2025-11-06 20:17:31', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(193, 2233486, 'Central Indiana Manufacturing | Warehouse Facility', 'Industrial | 182,238 SqFt', '<h4 style=\"text-align: center\"></h4><h4 style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">    STARTING BID MEETS RESERVE</span></strong></h4><hr><p>IN Auctioneer: Stephen Dawson, AU12500067 Crexi Technologies, AC32500016</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700\">Alexsis Wolfson | 949-799-4658 | aaguirre@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>Introducing an exceptional investment opportunity in Central Indiana - the 801 BERRYMAN PIKE property located in Tipton, IN.​ This expansive industrial facility boasting over 182,000 SF and set on approximately 9.56 acres is now available for sale via ABSOLUTE auction.​ Featuring a rich history as a steel manufacturing and stamping plant for over 70 years, this versatile property is primed for a new owner or investor looking to capitalize on its capabilities for high-production use in a prospering labor market.​ Key property highlights include (7) Grade-Level Overhead Doors, (4) Dock-Height Overhead Doors, ceiling heights ranging from 18\' to 24\', 3-phase electrical service, and the convenience of rail service nearby.​ Positioned less than 10 minutes from a major U.​S.​ highway, with ample parking and room for future expansion, this vacant facility offers immediate occupancy potential.​ Don\'t miss your chance to own a piece of industrial history in a strategic location ready for a new chapter of success!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Close of Escrow: December 30<sup>th</sup>, 2025</span></strong></p><p> </p><p>801 Berryman Pike, Tipton, IN 46072</p>', 475000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'indiana-central-indiana-manufacturing-warehouse-facility', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2233486/indiana-central-indiana-manufacturing-warehouse-facility', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2233486/680c49f534bb4ec3aa84d2e0feccaf7d_716x444.jpg', 52, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-11-07 23:04:35', '2025-11-25 20:30:47', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
