(195, 2167757, '.71 Acre Development Site', 'Located in Mixed Residential & Commercially Developed Area', '<p>Wisconsin Auctioneer: Wagenson Auction Service, Carol Wagenson, Lic.​ #1237 - 52, Registered Wisconsin Auctioneer</p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Hannah Ladenheim | 936-274-1332 | hladenheim@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\">Introducing an exceptional development opportunity in Wisconsin Rapids, WI! </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\">WI RAPIDS DEVELOPMENT SITE</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\"> located at </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\">2820 8th Street South, Wisconsin Rapids, WI 54494</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\">, offers a prime .71-acre lot ideal for retail development.​ Situated near the newly established Caribou Coffee Drive-Thru, this developer-owned property is available for lease, build-to-suit, or sale.​ Boasting dual access points and strategic positioning along WI-13 Trunk and Grove Avenue, the property caters to high visibility and accessibility.​ With a bustling tertiary market, Wisconsin Rapids witnessed over ±100,000 SF of retail absorption in 2023, making it a lucrative location for retail ventures.​ The demographic profile includes a population of approximately 6,079 within a mile radius, with an average household income of $70,162.​ Don\'t miss this chance to capitalize on a growing market and establish your retail presence in a thriving community! Contact us for more details on this sought-after </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(6, 34, 57, 1)\">WI RAPIDS DEVELOPMENT SITE</span></strong>!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum via wire deposit on or before closing</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong> </p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>·       </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Close of Escrow: December 30<sup>th</sup>, 2025</span></span></strong></p><p></p><p>2820 8th St S Wisconsin Rapids, WI 54494</p>', 25000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'wisconsin-71-acre-development-site', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2167757/wisconsin-71-acre-development-site', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2167757/d5f3214cbf024dfa9454ade9b300953d_716x444.jpg', 6, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-23 20:42:10', '2025-11-24 18:27:45', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(196, 2226545, 'Ocean Manor Beach Resort 6-Unit Portfolio', 'Hospitality | 6 Keys', '<p>          Exceptional Beachfront Investment Opportunity on the Galt Ocean Mile!</p><p>Presenting a rare opportunity to acquire a portfolio of six income-producing condominiums located within the iconic Ocean Manor Beach Resort—one of Fort Lauderdale’s premier oceanfront destinations.​ Situated directly on the sand, this collection of condos offers investors an unbeatable combination of strong cash flow, daily rental flexibility (Airbnb-friendly), and long-term capital appreciation in one of South Florida’s most sought-after coastal markets.​</p><p>Each fully furnished unit captures the essence of resort-style living—with access to premier amenities including a private beach, oceanfront heated pool, Tiki bar, 5-star Italian restaurant (Casa Calabria), on-site spa, salon, coffee bar, and valet parking.​ Guests and owners alike enjoy a vibrant, turn-key lifestyle steps from the Atlantic Ocean and just minutes from Fort Lauderdale’s best shopping, dining, and nightlife.​</p><p>This portfolio offers both consistent income and asset diversification, ideal for short-term rental investors, 1031 exchange buyers, or private equity seeking scalable beachfront exposure.​</p><p>            Investment Highlights – Ocean Manor Beach Resort Location</p><p>Prime Oceanfront Address: Located directly on the sand at 4040 Galt Ocean Drive, one of Fort Lauderdale’s most prestigious beachfront corridors.​</p><p>High-Demand Tourist Market: Year-round tourism destination attracting over 13 million annual visitors to Greater Fort Lauderdale.​</p><p>Flexible Rental Policy: No rental restrictions—operate daily, weekly, or monthly through Airbnb or on-site management.​</p><p>Full Resort Amenities: Tiki Bar, Casa Calabria Restaurant, Day Spa, Coffee Shop, Salon, Pool, and Beach Service.​</p><p>Proven Income Performance: Consistent occupancy and strong ADR driven by oceanfront location and resort demand.​</p><p>Walkable Lifestyle: Steps to grocery stores, boutique retail, gyms, and top-rated restaurants along Galt Ocean Mile.​</p><p>Proximity to Everything: Minutes to Las Olas Boulevard, Fort Lauderdale International Airport, and Port Everglades.​</p><p>Future Growth Potential: Surging redevelopment and luxury projects along Galt Ocean Mile enhance long-term appreciation.​ Seller financing available.​</p>', 3420500.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'florida-ocean-manor-beach-resort-6-unit-portfolio', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2226545/florida-ocean-manor-beach-resort-6-unit-portfolio', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2226545/a33353ef39754495b82467e6e4a2582f_716x444.jpg', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-21 21:44:50', '2025-10-21 21:47:23', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(198, 1762589, '4107 W Northern Ave', 'Great Development Opportunity!!!', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(33, 37, 41, 1)\">Exciting development opportunity in Southside Pueblo located along State Highway 76 situated upon 2.19 acres!! <span>Sellers are in the process of combing parcels/vacating lot lines and annexing into the city.​</span> Approximately 20,000 cars daily at the nearby Northern Ave and Pueblo Blvd intersection.​ This property is situated within close proximity to other major retail/grocery businesses, restaurants, gas and service stations, as well as nearby residential.​ Prime development opportunity but can be used as income producing in the interim.​ One three bedroom/two bath home, one two bedroom/two bath home and one 1,000 commercial building.​ Buyer to verify all information.​ Information deemed reliable but not guaranteed.​</span></p>', 1300000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Mixed Use\"]', '[]', 'colorado-4107-w-northern-ave', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1762589/colorado-4107-w-northern-ave', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1762589/757ccd8aa200454da587f3556f354be6_716x444.jpg', 11, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-01-31 17:30:24', '2025-10-02 18:20:21', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(199, 2231166, '48.43-Acre Industrial Land Opportunity', 'Fully Entitled | Zoned Commercial Industrial Park CIP', '<p><strong>AL Auctioneer: David Farmer, AL793</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 700\">Hannah Ladenheim | 936-274-1332 | hladenheim@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>Introducing Ashley Park Industrial Development, an exceptional opportunity in Huntsville, AL.​ Spanning approximately 48.436 acres, this fully entitled property on Stringfield Road is prime for industrial development.​ Position your industrial development or HVAC supply house here to leverage its strategic location next to James I.​ Dawson Elementary School.​ With industrial zoning and all utilities already in place, this site offers convenience and potential for growth.​ Enjoy easy access to Hwy 53, along with proximity to 255 and I-565 for seamless transportation connections.​ Benefit from completed survey and Geotech assessments to expedite your project timeline.​ Discover a thriving business environment surrounded by area employers, amenities, and main thoroughfares.​ Begin your next venture at Ashley Park Industrial Development and unlock the possibilities in this dynamic Huntsville location.​ For more information and to explore similar properties, visit chasecommercial.​com or scan the QR code for a closer look!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p></p><p>0 Stringfield Rd NW, Huntsville, AL 35810</p>', 350000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'alabama-4843-acre-industrial-land-opportunity', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2231166/alabama-4843-acre-industrial-land-opportunity', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2231166/55aef77dbd9f475d9fe2c222de4e0d4a_716x444.jpg', 8, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-28 20:18:46', '2025-11-04 19:27:46', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(200, 2035209, 'Daycare & Childcare Facility for Sale with Real Estate', 'Day Care Center', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Excellent Opportunity to PURCHASE FORMER DAYCARE BUILDINGS ON 1.5 ACRES Outparcel of a super busy shopping center.​ DAYCARE capacity of approx.​ 262 kids expandable upto 450 kids.​ Corner busy location.​ Currently vacant.​</span></p><ul><li>​<p>Courtyard</p></li><li>​<p>Storage Space</p></li><li>​<p>AC</p></li><li>​<p>Tenant Controlled HVAC</p></li><li>​<p>Bus Line</p></li><li>​<p>OUTPARCEL OF BUSY SHOPPING CENTER</p></li></ul><p>Unlock exceptional business potential with this expansive 1.5-acre commercial parcel on bustling Atlanta Highway.​ This highly visible outparcel, nestled within a thriving shopping center anchored by Big Lots, Citi Trends, and Domino\'s, enjoys prime exposure and significant daily traffic.​ Neighboring retail giants like Walmart, ALDI, and Publix further enhance its draw.​ Featuring three buildings, ample parking, and attractive landscaping, this former daycare center offers versatile space suitable for retail, restaurant, office, medical, entertainment, or continued daycare use.​ Capitalize on this strategic location and high-traffic flow to maximize your business success.​</p>', 1600000.00, 'Highest & Best', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'georgia-daycare-childcare-facility-for-sale-with-real-estate', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2035209/georgia-daycare-childcare-facility-for-sale-with-real-estate', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2035209/5701a8030030471dbfc5aea1924973ab_716x444.jpg', 16, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-23 17:13:17', '2025-10-22 22:08:41', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(201, 1841102, 'Louis Bank of Commerce', 'Iconic Louis Bank of Commerce – Historic Landmark with Prime Gaslamp Quarter Location | 22,580 SF', '<p>Cast Capital Partners is pleased to present the Louis Bank of Commerce, a rare opportunity to acquire one of San Diego’s most architecturally significant commercial properties.​ Built in 1888 and renowned as the Queen of the Gaslamp, this four-story Baroque Revival landmark blends historic charm with modern functionality.​ Over the years, it has hosted a variety of tenants, from Madame Cora’s Golden Poppy Hotel brothel to creative offices and popular restaurants.​ The building has been fully restored, showcasing its original hardwood floors, soaring ceilings, and exposed brick walls, offering a unique blend of old-world character and contemporary appeal.​ Located in the heart of the vibrant Gaslamp Quarter, the property is surrounded by top-tier dining, entertainment, and hospitality destinations, ensuring strong year-round demand.​ The Louis Bank of Commerce presents an excellent opportunity for investors seeking to reposition this iconic asset for long-term value.​ With its potential for conversion into a boutique hotel, featuring 36 rooms (subject to buyer’s yield study), or adaptive reuse as creative office and retail space, the property offers unparalleled flexibility.​ This prime location, coupled with San Diego’s growing tourism sector, makes the property an exceptional investment in one of the city’s most dynamic neighborhoods.​ With the Gaslamp Quarter seeing increasing foot traffic, strong occupancy rates, and high demand for boutique hotels, this is a rare chance to capitalize on the city’s thriving hospitality market.​ Offered at $9,000,000 with significant upside potential, the Louis Bank of Commerce is a landmark opportunity for investors or developers looking to make their mark in downtown San Diego.​</p>', 9000000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-louis-bank-of-commerce', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1841102/california-louis-bank-of-commerce', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1841102/b08f34200da04e34b26a22be9a090f58_716x444.jpg', 14, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-24 16:42:25', '2025-11-05 00:23:20', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(202, 2187228, 'SUPER 8 McAllen / Downtown / La Plaza', '49-Key Wyndham economy asset steps from La Plaza Mall & Downtown McAllen', '<h2>Please do not visit the property or contact on-site staff.​ All inquiries, NDAs, and tours must be coordinated exclusively through <strong>Avison Young</strong>.​</h2><p><strong>Price Improvement</strong></p><p>Positioned steps from <strong>La Plaza Mall</strong> and minutes to <strong>Downtown McAllen</strong>, this <strong>49-key</strong> Super 8 delivers durable budget demand in one of the Rio Grande Valley’s highest-traffic retail and services corridors.​ Guests benefit from immediate access to dining, shopping, and major thoroughfares—supporting year-round occupancy from leisure, cross-border, medical, and value-minded corporate travelers.​</p><p>The property’s compact footprint and national <strong>Wyndham</strong> branding provide operational efficiency and broad distribution, while the surrounding submarket continues to see steady population and commerce growth.​ This is an attractive play for investors seeking <strong>cash-flow today with clear value-add levers</strong> (room refresh, revenue management, cost controls, and local sales partnerships).​</p><p><strong>Seller Financing Available:</strong> The <strong>owner is willing to consider seller financing</strong> for qualified buyers, subject to price, terms, and credit—creating a capital-efficient path to closing and potential upside on returns.​</p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'texas-super-8-mcallen-downtown-la-plaza', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2187228/texas-super-8-mcallen-downtown-la-plaza', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2187228/6064d894e49f4a058cb644df43a1004b_716x444.jpg', 37, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-09-25 16:05:57', '2025-10-28 15:30:37', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(203, 2249817, '2 Unit NNN Property in Lynbrook, NY', 'Industrial | 7.51% CAP | 28,000 SqFt', '<p>AMC Real Estate Investment Services is pleased to offer for sale the 40 Rocklyn Ave NNN Retail Center, a pristine 28,000 SF, two-tenant investment property located in the heart of Lynbrook, NY’s coveted Merrick Road Corridor.​</p><p>Fully renovated in 2022 and 100% occupied by two powerhouse child-enrichment operators—All American Gymnastics (15,000 SF) and Steps to Success (13,000 SF)—this irreplaceable asset delivers immediate cash flow with a current NOI of $675,542 and a 8.0% cap rate at the $8,444,275 asking price.​</p>', 8444275.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\",\"Mixed Use\",\"Office\",\"Retail\",\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'new-york-2-unit-nnn-property-in-lynbrook-ny', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2249817/new-york-2-unit-nnn-property-in-lynbrook-ny', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2249817/5f5c1b489bc24c4eb4e82808dd751bc5_716x444.jpg', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-10 13:12:10', '2025-11-25 20:25:36', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(204, 1929710, '6009- 6017 INTERNATIONAL BLVD', 'Industrial | 14,500 SF', '<p>SVN | Capital West Partners, as the exclusive advisor, is pleased to present for sale 6009-6017 International Blvd, Oakland, CA (“the Property”), a ±14,500 square foot multi-tenant auto repair facility.​ Currently operating as an auto body shop and collision center, the Property offers in-place income and a flexible layout ideally suited for automotive uses or garage operations.​ The site is also adaptable for a variety of commercial uses, and its favorable zoning allows for Commercial, Office, and Residential (mixed-use) development, positioning it as a compelling opportunity for future multi-story redevelopment.​ Strategically located along International Blvd with convenient access to Highways 880 and 580, the Property benefits from strong visibility and connectivity.​</p>', 3262500.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-6009--6017-international-blvd', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1929710/california-6009--6017-international-blvd', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1929710/9f39c32a9a7e4ba1b2633b6d4b74c5c1_716x444.jpg', 16, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2025-05-19 16:16:49', '2025-09-02 20:33:30', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(205, 1720337, 'Bristol Mixed Use Property', 'Investment Property AND Successful Business Opportunity! Downtown Bristol, VA Unique Opportunity!', '<p>Investment Property AND Successful Business Opportunity! Located at the merging of Commonwealth Avenue and Sycamore Street in downtown Bristol, VA, this 1.09 acre site has a unique mix of 2-story building, 4-story building and large warehouse for a total of 44,921 Sq Ft.​  Brick buildings have been well maintained, nicely preserving the original historic brick and wood interiors.​  The Door Store currently occupies with ground level with an additional 13,300 Sq Ft of leasable space with private access on upper floors allowing for additional income generating opportunity.​  Warehouse has loading docks and overhead doors surrounding building with paved parking lots on both ends of property with the addition of multiple street front spaces.​  Uniquely located in bustling area, close to historic downtown Bristol and within one mile of the new Hard Rock Hotel and Casino development.​ With the endless opportunities this property has to offer, it\'s ready to become the cornerstone of your Entrepreneurial dreams!</p><p>Included in the sale is The Door Store, Windows and More business, a custom and standard door and window, garage door, mobile home supply and decking company.​ Since 2008 The Door Store has been providing high-value, made-to-order products plus installation service.​ The business is known for unparalleled craftsmanship and customer satisfaction, this is a unique chance to acquire a stable and profitable business.​  The prospective new owner will have immediate access to well-established brands, marketing materials, and a professional website that generates leads.​ Our extensive network of suppliers and industry connections will save you precious time and effort when sourcing materials and building relationships with clients.​  See the business website at: <a href=\"https://www.thedoorstorewindowsandmore.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.​thedoorstorewindowsandmore.​com</a></p><p>Tenant – Southern Refrigeration Corporation currently occupies 15,000 sq ft of primarily warehouse space generating $5,000/mo.​ gross income with tenant paying utilities and maintenance.​  Southern Refrigeration Corporation was established in January of 1947 in Roanoke, Virginia and has evolved into eleven branches located throughout the Commonwealth.​  It is a full line/full service Heating, Air Conditioning and Refrigeration Wholesale Distributor currently serving customers in the Mid-Atlantic region and beyond.​ See the business website at: <a href=\"https://srcusa.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://srcusa.​com/</a></p><p>Vacant Area - this is the entire upper floors of the building with perhaps the most potential! The attractive wood beams, supports and exposed brick maintain the original building’s design.​ The wood floors plus a mix of carpet and flooring continue throughout.​ One distinctive detail is the open spacious ramp between floors as opposed to enclosed stairs.​ Imagine the uses for this place – brewery, distillery, event center, restaurant, music hall, specialty shops, vintage décor store, open concept office space, residential lofts and so many more.​</p><p>This is the perfect opportunity for a quality-focused buyer or entrepreneur seeking a niche market with great potential in one of the leading areas of growth in the nation.​ Bristol is an ideal location to do business due to its strategic location in the Tri-Cities area, a supportive business environment, a vibrant lifestyle and cultural attractions like the Birthplace of Country Music Museum and Bristol Rhythm and Roots Reunion, and a thriving downtown with pedestrian-friendly streets.​ The area also benefits from a skilled workforce, access to educational institutions, and a rich cultural heritage.​ We\'re in what the Wall Street Journal calls an emerging market, where housing is still a good investment and it’s a great place to live.​  </p><p> </p>', 4000000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\",\"Mixed Use\",\"Office\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'virginia-1087-sycamore-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1720337/virginia-1087-sycamore-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1720337/f41715d1363a4c4abd00b3bfcfeca726_716x444.jpg', 24, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2024-11-20 14:07:10', '2025-11-05 17:05:37', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(206, 2249905, '7-Eleven | Orlando, FL', 'Retail | 5.00% CAP | 6,316 SqFt', '<p>SAB Capital is pleased to present the exclusive offering of a single-tenant, net-leased 7-Eleven located in Orlando, FL.​ This exceptional investment is secured by an absolute triple net (NNN) lease with over 4 years of remaining term along with 10% increases After 10 years and four 5-year options.​</p><p>7-Eleven currently operates roughly 12,500 locations in the USA and is the world\'s largest convenience store operator.​ The site has a corporate guarantee.​ With an A credit rating from S&P and a Baa2 rating from Moody\'s, 7-Eleven is considered an investment grade tenant.​</p><p>Strategically located in Orlando at the intersection of Presidents Drive and Sand Lake Rd, the property benefits from superior visibility, signage and access with traffic counts exceeding 50,000 vehicles per day.​ The property is within 1 mile to the Florida Mall, the largest mall in Central Florida with over 20 million visitors every year (2 million SF and 270+ stores & restaurants), and 3 miles away from SeaWord (4.6 million annual visitors).​</p><p>The nearby surrounding retail space includes national tenants such as,Walmart, Best Buy, Lowe\'s, Sams Club, Dollar Tree, Pet Smart, CVS, Ross for Less, Chik-fil-A, Chipotle, Dunkin\' and Walgreens.​</p><p>With its strong real estate fundamentals, triple-net lease structure, corporate guarantee and premier location, this offering truly represents a passive, low-risky opportunity.​</p>', 4687680.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'florida-7-eleven-orlando-fl', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2249905/florida-7-eleven-orlando-fl', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2249905/9e2155e37498480eb037d5d78d57116d_716x444.jpg', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-11 16:48:09', '2025-11-11 16:48:09', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(207, 2232396, '7,680 SF Stand Alone Building', 'Huge Power - 2,000 AMPS | 2:1,000 Parking | 16\' Clearance', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 700\">Hannah Ladenheim | 936-274-1332| hladenheim@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>68350 Commercial Road presents a versatile commercial opportunity in Cathedral City’s established business-industrial corridor.​ Zoned CBP-2 (Commercial Business Park District), the property accommodates a wide range of commercial, service, and light-industrial uses — including cocktail lounges and bars, professional offices, light manufacturing, auto service, and distribution facilities, as well as licensed cannabis operations such as cultivation, manufacturing, distribution, and testing laboratories.​ Featuring 2,000 amps of 3-phase power, 16-foot clear height, and convenient access to I-10 and major retail anchors, the site is ideal for either reactivation or redevelopment.​ Cathedral City has recently lifted its moratorium on new cannabis applications, positioning this property for strong investor and owner-user demand as the local market reopens and diversified business activity expands.​</p><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Non-Contingent</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Earnest Money Deposit: Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></span></strong></li></ul><p> 68350 Commercial Rd, Cathedral City, CA 92234</p>', 250000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'california-7680-sf-stand-alone-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2232396/california-7680-sf-stand-alone-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2232396/f8289e88026a4d13aa34b61db6848cda_716x444.jpg', 33, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2025-11-03 23:35:38', '2025-11-24 14:33:21', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(208, 1113950, 'Extra Space Storage (3rd Party Managed)', 'Institutional-Grade Self Storage Opportunity in a High-Demand, Infill Tulsa MSA Location', '<p>Extra Space Storage (3rd party managed) is a self-storage conversion project which opened in July 2020 and has been managed<br>by Extra Space since December 2022.​ It possesses prominent frontage with reader board signage and is located on Kenosha Street.​ <br>The property is sited on 4.62 acres in a densely developed area of Broken Arrow, less than a mile from the revitalized Rose District, <br>with strong demographics ($111,116 AHHI) and population (73,000) within the three-mile trade area.​The property has undertaken extensive renovations over the past couple of years including but not limited to:</p><p>• TPO roof overlay with 20-year transferable warranty</p><p>• Exterior glass window walls</p><p>• Updated facility office</p><p><br><strong>Storage Upside</strong></p><p>There is significant upside remaining through capturing the tenant insurance revenue, and moving forward with the approved PUD Amendment for expansion and monetizing the pad site to lower the purchase basis.​</p>', 6400000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Self Storage\"]', '[]', 'oklahoma-extra-space-storage-3rd-party-managed', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1113950/oklahoma-extra-space-storage-3rd-party-managed', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1113950/947a0de1d8e940358897accad9c21e62_716x444.jpg', 17, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-21 21:26:56', '2025-11-21 22:43:44', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(209, 1333547, '522 E 2nd St.', 'Retail | 1,756 SqFt', '.​', 1.00, 'Highest & Best', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'new-york-522-e-2nd-st', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1333547/new-york-522-e-2nd-st', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1333547/c274bf36d6344ae3b128a4594060626c_716x444.jpg', 7, 1, 0, 0, 1, '2024-02-13 11:02:39', '2025-11-10 03:45:16', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(210, 2251239, 'Town & Country Shopping Center', 'Kroger Anchored Center | Value Add | Low PSF', '<p>Anchored by Kroger and Kroger Fuel Center, the property benefits from consistent daily traffic and serves as a dominant retail destination within the market.​ In addition to the main center, the offering includes several outparcels occupied by strong national brands such as Popeyes, Arby’s, Chuck E.​ Cheese, Subway, and Firestone.​ Currently ~80% occupied, the center offers meaningful value-add potential through lease-up of the remaining vacancies and development of a fully improved pad site adjacent to Kroger that is ready for vertical construction.​ The property is positioned along a high-growth retail corridor supported by dense surrounding demographics, strong visibility, and proximity to major demand drivers including Notre Dame University and the regional retail hub along Grape Road.​</p>', 14000000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'indiana-town-country-shopping-center', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2251239/indiana-town-country-shopping-center', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2251239/4aba115af9684c34a964e81b93e96fb2_716x444.jpg', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-11 16:51:53', '2025-11-11 16:51:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(211, 2215587, 'Arrow Building', '21,162 SF Building | 1.44 Acre Lot', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">TN Auctioneer:  Jacob Farr - TN 7189</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span>Hannah Ladenheim <span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">| 936-274-1332 | hladenheim@</span></strong><a href=\"crexi.com\" target=\"_blank\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">crexi.​com</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">.​</span></strong></p><p>Introducing 650 New York Street, a fully renovated flex building in the vibrant heart of Midtown Memphis.​ Boasting a perfect blend of industrial functionality, modern office finishes, and creative studio space, this 21,162 SF property on a 1.44-acre parcel is a versatile gem in a prime location.​ Featuring 58 parking spaces with gated access, multiple loading docks, and a key card system, it is excellently revamped for owner-users, investors, or creative operators.​ With interior highlights such as built-out artist studios, a modern conference room, and retail-style finishes, this property offers flexibility for various uses, from industrial to office or showroom space.​ Located within a designated Opportunity Zone and surrounded by amenities, 650 New York Street is ideally situated, with easy access to downtown Memphis, I-240, and the medical district.​ Whether you seek a unique headquarters, creative hub, or lucrative investment, this property delivers unmatched style, flexibility, and location!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>·       </span></span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Close of Escrow: December 30<sup>th</sup>, 2025</span></span></strong></p><p>650 New York St, Memphis, TN 38104</p>', 250000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'tennessee-arrow-building', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2215587/tennessee-arrow-building', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2215587/73ddcfb89c87464e81c458eec2284732_716x444.jpg', 43, 0, 1, 0, 1, '2025-10-24 19:51:24', '2025-11-24 18:19:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(212, 2212571, 'Nappa Car Wash | Express Tunnel | Business & Real Estate', '10 Vacuums | 0.5 Miles from Interstate 50', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Wisconsin Auctioneer: Wagenson Auction Service, Carol Wagenson, Lic.​ #1237 - 52, Registered Wisconsin Auctioneer</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Audrey Hanna | 518-625-8581 | ahanna@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p>Introducing an exclusive opportunity to own Nappa Car Wash located at 2911 75th St, Kenosha, WI 53143.​ This established car wash sits on 0.57 acres of prime real estate, boasting 10 vacuums and a convenient location just 0.5 miles from Interstate 50.​ Key Investment Highlights: - Perfect for owner-users or investors looking for a turnkey business - Stable income from a loyal customer base and membership model - Strategic residential neighborhood setting ensures steady traffic flow - Close proximity to Interstate 50 attracts both locals and travelers Don\'t miss the chance to acquire this lucrative business with reliable cash flow.​ Bidding starts at a competitive $250,000.​ Take advantage of this rare opportunity to own a profitable car wash in a sought-after location.​ Contact us for registration details and secure your spot in the auction!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum via wire deposit on or before closing</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p> </p><p>2911 75th St, Kenosha, WI 53143</p>', 250000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Special Purpose\"]', '[]', 'wisconsin-nappa-car-wash-express-tunnel-business-real-estate', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2212571/wisconsin-nappa-car-wash-express-tunnel-business-real-estate', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2212571/581bd8d9cd2045df9adcb096844273b4_716x444.jpg', 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-24 19:38:17', '2025-11-24 18:37:48', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54');
INSERT INTO `properties` (`id`, `external_id`, `name`, `description`, `marketing_description`, `asking_price`, `status`, `types`, `subtypes`, `url_slug`, `external_url`, `thumbnail_url`, `number_of_images`, `has_flyer`, `has_video`, `has_virtual_tour`, `is_in_opportunity_zone`, `activated_on`, `external_updated_on`, `created_at`, `updated_at`) VALUES
(213, 2209525, 'Former Commissary Kitchen/Food Production Facility', 'Storefront', '<p><strong>OH Auctioneer: Stephen Dawson, OH 2023000138.​</strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><b><span>Alexsis Wolfson |\n949-799-4658 | aaguirre@crexi.​com<span>.​</span></span></b></p><p>Property tours are available by appointment only.​ Please contact the listing broker to schedule a tour.​</p><p>This is a versatile 9,263 SF property that offers a unique blend of a commissary kitchen/food production facility with the potential for conversion to general-purpose use.​ Strategically located with easy access to I-75 and I-71 via Ronald Reagan Highway, this property also boasts a large fenced outdoor area and an outbuilding with electric service and a 10\' x 10\' overhead door.​ Ideal for entrepreneurs looking to establish or expand their culinary ventures, this property features updated floor drains and ample space to accommodate various business needs.​ Take advantage of the central Greater Cincinnati location.​ Don\'t miss out on this prime real estate opportunity with endless possibilities.​ </p><ul><li>​<strong style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Earnest Money Deposit: Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Marketing Fee: 3% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Close of Escrow: 12/30/2025</span></span></strong></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: justify\"> 30 Illinois Ave, Cincinnati, OH 45215</p>', 100000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'ohio-former-commissary-kitchenfood-production-facility', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2209525/ohio-former-commissary-kitchenfood-production-facility', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2209525/c2639e29620d438f83332864797564f3_716x444.jpg', 47, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-21 17:30:28', '2025-11-24 18:17:48', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(214, 1557106, 'Retail Commercial', 'Former Lucero Olive oil High Visibility Location', '<h3 style=\"text-align: justify\">Prime Retail & Warehouse Investment Opportunity | Corning, CA</h3><p>Unlock the potential of this <strong>versatile 7.22-acre commercial property</strong>, offered in two contiguous parcels, located in the heart of Corning, California.​ This rare opportunity combines <strong>high-visibility retail frontage</strong> with expansive <strong>warehouse infrastructure</strong>, making it ideal for a wide range of commercial, industrial, or mixed-use development.​</p><p>🏢 Property Highlights:</p><ul><li>​<p><strong>1,654 SF freestanding retail storefront</strong> with modern industrial charm</p></li><li>​<p><strong>14,000+ SF warehouse</strong> with high ceilings and two oversized roll-up doors (24\' x 28\')</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Three climate-controlled rooms</strong>:</p><ul><li>​<p>30\'0\" x 32\'6\" (formerly a food-grade bottling room)</p></li><li>​<p>24\'7\" x 21\'2\" (boxing/shipping)</p></li><li>​<p>49\'0\" x 57\'9\" (inventory storage)</p></li></ul></li><li>​<p><strong>Additional amenities</strong>: tasting room, conference room, multiple offices, and 3 restrooms</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Private gated entry</strong> for added security and operational control</p></li></ul><p>🚚 Infrastructure & Flexibility:</p><ul><li>​<p>Designed for food production, distribution, or light manufacturing</p></li><li>​<p>Adaptable for retail, logistics, e-commerce fulfillment, or agri-business</p></li><li>​<p>Ample acreage for future expansion, parking, or auxiliary structures</p></li></ul><p>📍 Strategic Location:</p><ul><li>​<p><strong>Outstanding visibility</strong> on Highway 99, with signage exposure to <strong>over 39,500 vehicles daily</strong></p></li><li>​<p><strong>Visible from Interstate 5</strong>, ensuring regional reach and easy access</p></li><li>​<p>Surrounded by established businesses and just minutes from <strong>Rolling Hills Casino & Event Center</strong></p></li><li>​<p>Located 40 minutes from both <strong>Redding and Chico</strong>, in a growing corridor between the Shasta and Lassen mountain ranges</p></li></ul><p></p><p>This property offers a <strong>rare blend of functionality, location, and development upside</strong>—ideal for investors, owner-users, or visionary developers seeking a foothold in Northern California’s emerging commercial landscape.​</p>', 1800000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\",\"Mixed Use\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'california-retail-commercial', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1557106/california-retail-commercial', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1557106/490af724aada444a880ca2eff2f45a68_716x444.jpg', 71, 1, 0, 1, 0, '2024-06-10 22:58:42', '2025-11-18 19:36:26', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(215, 1685382, 'Union at JTown', 'Multifamily | 131 Units', '<p>Union at JTown: A Prime Multifamily Investment in Louisville’s Top Submarket</p><p>Silvestri Real Estate presents the <strong>exclusive </strong>listing for Union at JTown Apartments, a <strong>131-unit multifamily complex </strong>strategically located in Louisville’s desirable Jeffersontown submarket.​ This property offers a compelling opportunity for investors seeking strong, immediate returns and future growth.​</p><p><strong>INVESTMENT HIGHLIGHTS</strong></p><p>The current ownership has invested over <strong>$3 million in capital expenditures </strong>since 2020, transforming the property and eliminating deferred maintenance.​ Renovations include premium finishes like <strong>stone countertops, stainless steel appliances, modern cabinetry, and washer/dryer connections</strong>.​ This extensive upgrade allows a new owner to <strong>immediately benefit from a well-maintained, stabilized asset </strong>and focus on efficient operations.​</p><p>The property is currently under-rented, with in-place effective rents <strong>$55 below market rate</strong>.​ A new owner can organically bridge this gap, capturing significant upside and increasing the property’s cash flow without additional capital improvements.​</p><p>Union at JTown consists of two parcels: 77 units on Sprowl Road and 54 units on Grand Avenue, located less than a half-mile apart.​ This dual-parcel structure offers operational flexibility while capturing a significant presence in the Jeffersontown market.​</p><p><strong>ATTRACTIVE ASSUMABLE DEBT</strong></p><p>A key advantage of this acquisition is the <strong>attractive assumable loan</strong>, offering a competitive interest rate and favorable terms.​ This provides a clear path to a streamlined closing and substantial interest savings.​</p><p><strong>Loan Balance: </strong>$7,597,000</p><p><strong>Lender: </strong>Fannie Mae (CBRE Capital Markets)</p><p><strong>Interest Rate: </strong>3.11%</p><p><strong>Loan Term: </strong>12 years (originated April 2020)</p><p><strong>Maturity Date: </strong>May 1, 2032</p><p><strong>Interest-Only Period: </strong>7 years (completed)</p><p><strong>Yield Maintenance Period: </strong>Ends October 31, 2031</p>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[]', 'kentucky-union-at-jtown', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1685382/kentucky-union-at-jtown', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1685382/997a2d3b0f44481eb72036878cbce631_716x444.jpg', 31, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-09-17 18:52:07', '2025-09-19 15:34:56', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(216, 2199099, '7-Eleven - Leesburg, FL', 'NEW 2024 CONSTRUCTION | QUALIFIES FOR 100% DEPRECIATION | DIESEL LANES', NULL, 13050000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'florida-7-eleven---leesburg-fl', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2199099/florida-7-eleven---leesburg-fl', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2199099/b55b51e6c98647ff95613a574da3f335_716x444.jpg', 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-10-07 14:21:23', '2025-10-07 16:48:50', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(217, 2252225, 'Beef-a-Roo - Syracuse, IN 46567', 'Quick Service Restaurant | Syracuse, IN | 8.75% CAP', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">BEEF-A-ROO - </span>Syracuse, IN -</strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> Investment Opportunity in </span>Syracuse, IN<span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">!</span></p><p><em><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">For Inquires, contact: </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">kevin@</span></strong></em><a href=\"eiacq.com\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">eiacq.​com</span></strong></em></a><em><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\"> </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">/ sumair@</span></strong></em><a href=\"eiacq.com\" target=\"_blank\"><em><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 1)\">eiacq.​com</span></strong></em></a></p><p>This property in <strong>Syracuse, IN</strong> is home to a thriving <strong>Beef-a-Roo</strong>, a popular fast-casual restaurant known for its signature burgers, sandwiches, and shakes.​ Ideally positioned on <strong>0.51 acres</strong>, the <strong>1,862-square-foot</strong> building sits along a highly visible, high-traffic corridor with easy access and strong surrounding demographics.​ The site features modern construction with a drive-thru and ample customer parking, making it a convenient destination for both dine-in and drive-through guests.​</p><p>Surrounded by established neighborhoods, retail centers, and schools, the property benefits from consistent local traffic and brand visibility.​ The investment is secured by a <strong>brand-new 20-year absolute NNN lease</strong> with <strong>2% annual rent increases</strong> and a <strong>corporate guaranty</strong> from the operator, providing zero landlord responsibilities and predictable long-term income.​</p><p>With a <strong>net operating income of $171,000</strong>, an <strong>9.0% cap rate</strong>, and a <strong>purchase price of $1,900,000</strong>, this property presents an excellent opportunity for investors seeking a stable, recession-resilient quick-service restaurant asset in a growing regional market.​</p><p>Don’t miss the chance to acquire a proven, high-performing retail property in the heart of <strong>Syracuse, Indiana</strong>.​ Contact us today for more information on this outstanding investment opportunity with <strong>Beef-a-Roo</strong>.​</p>', 1900000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'indiana-beef-a-roo---syracuse-in-46567', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2252225/indiana-beef-a-roo---syracuse-in-46567', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2252225/0b164f2a29ef477fa33d74cef37358fb_716x444.jpg', 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-12 16:32:31', '2025-11-21 21:41:18', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(218, 1924754, 'Texas Health Breeze Urgent Care (Corporate Guaranty)', 'Retail | 4.85% CAP | 3,002 SF', '<p>Kidder Mathews and Bang Realty is pleased to present the opportunity to acquire a freestanding Texas Health Resources medical clinic located at 4635 Frankford Road in Dallas, Texas.​ This ±3,002 SF facility sits on ±0.57 acres and is 100% leased to Texas Health Resources under an absolute NNN lease with no landlord responsibilities.​ The lease commenced in December 2020 and extends through November 2030, featuring 2.5% fixed annual rent increases—a rare feature in single tenant NNN leases and two (2) five year renewal options.​</p><p>The subject property is an outparcel to a newly remodeled Tom Thumb grocery store, benefiting from excellent visibility, strong daily traffic, and retail synergy.​ It is located in an affluent, densely populated area of North Dallas, surrounded by established residential neighborhoods, top-rated schools, and high household incomes, further supporting long-term tenant performance and demand for medical services.​</p><p>Offered at $2,941,278 the property provides a cap rate of 4.85%.​ Backed by a corporate guaranty from Texas Health Resources, one of the largest nonprofit health systems in the U.​S.​ with investment-grade credit, this offering delivers a stable, management-free investment in one of Dallas’ most desirable healthcare corridors.​ An ideal opportunity for 1031 exchange buyers or investors seeking secure, inflation-hedged cash flow.​</p>', 2941278.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'texas-texas-health-breeze-urgent-care-corporate-guaranty', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1924754/texas-texas-health-breeze-urgent-care-corporate-guaranty', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1924754/224e9cf0195641099a5f47417e01d729_716x444.jpg', 5, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-05-12 18:47:26', '2025-08-15 21:18:32', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
