(220, 1938796, 'TruGreen Lawn Care | NEW 10-Year Absolute NNN Lease', '2.5% Annual Increases | New Lease Commences July 1, 2025', '<p>Absolute NNN Single Tenant Industrial</p>', 1600000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Industrial\"]', '[]', 'ohio-trugreen-lawn-care-new-10-year-absolute-nnn-lease', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1938796/ohio-trugreen-lawn-care-new-10-year-absolute-nnn-lease', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1938796/2fa51d32ef3044fab3736cb485c41d33_716x444.jpg', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-05-28 21:48:55', '2025-10-23 18:36:11', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(221, 2031668, 'Land For Sale - Prime Frontage Near Beltway 8', 'Land | 1.43 acres', '<p>Outstanding opportunity to own nearly 1.5 acres (3 combined lots) with direct frontage on Old Humble Road—just feet from the Beltway 8 intersection.​ This high-traffic, high-profile location offers unmatched visibility in a rapidly developing area.​ </p><p>Suitable for:</p><p>✔️ Storage facility or box units</p><p>✔️ Gas station</p><p>✔️ Laundromat</p><p>Strategically positioned in a fast-growing corridor, this property offers a strong investment opportunity in one of Humble’s most active commercial zones.​</p>', 0.00, 'Highest & Best', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'texas-land-for-sale---prime-frontage-near-beltway-8', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2031668/texas-land-for-sale---prime-frontage-near-beltway-8', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2031668/ee6eca2cac484fe4aad0689d2c67ca73_716x444.jpg', 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-18 20:55:34', '2025-11-17 18:10:31', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(222, 2253483, 'Popeyes | 17.5+ Years NNN | 63-Unit Guaranty', '10% Rental Increases every 5 Years', '<p>SRS National Net Lease is pleased to offer the opportunity to acquire the fee simple interest (land & building ownership) in an absolute NNN leased, Popeyes investment property located in Harpersville, Alabama.​ The tenant, AIM QSR, LLC, has 17.5+ years remaining with 4 (5-year) options to extend, demonstrating their commitment to the site.​ The lease features 10% rental increases every 5 years throughout the initial term and options, steadily growing NOI and hedging against inflation.​ The lease is absolute NNN with zero landlord responsibilities making it an ideal, management free investment opportunity for a passive investor.​ Popeyes is a subsidiary of Restaurant Brands International Inc.​ is one of the world’s largest quick service restaurant companies with more than $40 billion in annual system-wide sales and over 30,000 restaurants in more than 100 countries.​</p><p>The Popeyes is located near the signalized, hard corner intersection of State Hwy 53 and U.​S.​ Hwy 231 with a combined 24,700 VPD.​ The site is in close proximity to multiple national/credit tenants including Marathon, Dollar General, Exxon, Chevron, Jack’s, and many more.​ Strong tenant synergy increases consumer draw to the immediate trade area and promotes crossover store exposure to the site.​ Furthermore, the asset is near Coosa Valley Academy (237 students), further increasing consumer traffic to the immediate trade area.​ The 5-mile trade area is supported by a population of over 4,000 and 1,000 employees.​ Residents within a 1-mile trade radius boast an affluent average household income of $105,707.​</p>', 1244000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'alabama-popeyes-175-years-nnn-63-unit-guaranty', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2253483/alabama-popeyes-175-years-nnn-63-unit-guaranty', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2253483/451182b448b046d48f3e408c5c4ebc20_716x444.jpg', 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-18 23:53:22', '2025-11-18 23:55:16', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(223, 1839308, 'Hamilton Shops - Hamilton, OH', '100% Leased Shopping Center | Shadow Anchored by Kroger | High Yield - 8.55% CAP', '<p>Sands Investment Group is Pleased to Exclusively Offer For Sale the Hamilton Shops Strip Center Located at 1476-1496 South Erie Boulevard in Hamilton, OH.​ The Property Includes a 100% Leased 6 Tenant Strip Center on a Long Term Ground Lease (Ground Lease Runs For 66 Years Including Options) Providing a New Investor Long Term Security, Strong Cash Flow & Full Depreciation Benefits.​ Shadow Anchored By a Top Producing Kroger Grocery Store (Placer.​ai.​) With 1.3M Visits Per Year, the Subject Property Benefits From a Strong Destination Location and Customer Draw.​ With a Long Term Operating History and Low Historical Vacancy, This Property Provides an Investor Security, High Yield, Low Cost Per Square Foot and Favorable Depreciation Benefits.​ </p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://signnn.com/listing-inventory/hamilton-shops-shopping-center-asset-hamilton-ohio/?utm_source=Crexi&utm_medium=Crexi-SIG&utm_campaign=Hamilton_Shops_Hamilton\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 85, 204, 1)\">LEARN MORE HERE</span></a></p>', 2350000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'ohio-hamilton-shops---hamilton-oh', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1839308/ohio-hamilton-shops---hamilton-oh', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1839308/a0dce42b1f5c432fa397f272a14e1b42_716x444.jpg', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-21 11:05:09', '2025-09-26 14:26:33', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(224, 2195325, 'RTI Ready To Issue - 11,592 SF Redevelopment Lot - ED1 | 100 % Affordable Housing', 'ED1 Project | PRIME LOS ANGELES REAL ESTATE | 11,592 SqFt | 47 UNITS', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Hannah Ladenheim | 936-274-1332 | hladenheim@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p>4424-4428 S.​ Western Avenue, Los Angeles, CA 90062 presents an exceptional opportunity for affordable housing development in South Los Angeles.​ This shovel-ready project offers a four-story, 47-unit Type V-A apartment building with a roof deck open space and no on-site parking requirement.​ Situated in a Transit Oriented Community Tier 3 zone, the property benefits from density and parking incentives, making it a prime investment for developers and investors seeking a streamlined and cost-effective development process.​ Featuring a unit mix of all one-bedroom units, this fully entitled project caters to Very Low-Income and Low-Income households in a high-demand market.​ With full entitlements and readiness to issue building permits, this offering is ideal for mission-driven developers, non-profit organizations, or LIHTC-focused investors looking to make a difference in Los Angeles\' housing landscape.​ Contact us today for the full due diligence package and seize this opportunity to deliver much-needed affordable housing while maximizing your investment potential!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 3% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\">4424 - 4428 S Western Ave, Los Angeles, CA 90062</p>', 500000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'california-rti-ready-to-issue---11592-sf-redevelopment-lot---ed1-100-affordable-housing', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2195325/california-rti-ready-to-issue---11592-sf-redevelopment-lot---ed1-100-affordable-housing', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2195325/a1cd4ca50eb04514957fee55c17c09bc_716x444.jpg', 28, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-07 17:09:51', '2025-11-25 19:48:13', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(225, 2260268, 'Aspen Dental- New Castle, PA', 'Aspen Dental | Walmart Outparcel | Low Rent & Price PSF', '<p>The property is strategically positioned in a strong commercial corridor along W State Street, a primary retail and commuter artery for the New Castle market.​ Nearby national co-tenants include Walmart Supercenter, Sheetz, Taco Bell, Giant Eagle, Chipotle, and McDonalds providing significant consumer draw and traffic flow to the immediate trade area.​</p><p>• Traffic Count: ~12,000 VPD</p><p>• Building Size: ~3,200 SF</p><p>• Lot Size: ~0.58 Acres</p><p></p><p>New Castle serves as a central retail and healthcare hub for Lawrence County, benefiting from stable population demand, regional employment drivers, and a strong medical services presence.​ The location offers long-term leasing stability and attractive residual real estate value.​</p><p></p>', 1456457.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Office\",\"Retail\"]', '[]', 'pennsylvania-aspen-dental--new-castle-pa', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2260268/pennsylvania-aspen-dental--new-castle-pa', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2260268/9afecfe81b264a69bf63f2d20ea789f6_716x444.jpg', 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-21 16:10:03', '2025-11-21 16:26:16', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(226, 2250454, '36 Unit, Two-Story Apartment Complex', 'Inverrary on the Lake', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Bianca Diorio | 954-302-3810 | bianca@crexi.​com.​</span></strong></p><p><strong>Touring is available December 12th from 10am-2pm.​ Please RSVP with Erik Leon at erik.​leon@matthews.​com.​</strong></p><p>Introducing INVERRARY ON THE LAKE, a prime investment opportunity located at 2561, 2571, 2581 and 2591 NW 56th Ave, Lauderhill, FL 33313.​ This 36-unit apartment complex offers a mix of spacious floor plans, including two-bedroom layouts, all set in a picturesque lakeside environment.​ With market rents set to increase significantly, this property presents strong income potential, boasting modern amenities like a community pool and clubhouse.​ Situated close to major highways and various amenities, Inverrary on the Lake provides convenience for both residents and potential investors.​ The property also includes additional income opportunities with 18 storage units and individual central A/C in each unit.​ Don\'t miss out on this unique chance to own a well-located asset with solid growth prospects in a rapidly developing area.​ For sale price and further details, contact the broker today!</p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Non-Contingent</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Earnest Money Deposit is Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align: justify\"><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">·       </span><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\">$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></strong></p><p> </p><p>2561, 2571, 2581 and 2591 NW 56th Ave, Lauderhill, FL 33313</p>', 2000000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Multifamily\"]', '[\"Apartment Building\"]', 'florida-inverrary-on-the-lake-36-units', NULL, 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2250454/3a22619eae7f44ec84d792c2169025aa_716x444.jpg', 34, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-11-17 20:26:24', '2025-12-16 19:31:32', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-17 07:35:04'),
(227, 1927839, 'Red Roof Brand / Auto Transfer / Absentee Owner', 'NEW! - $ 6.1B Chip manufacturing / Construction begins in November 2025', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">COMING SOON  - NEW!  -  $ 6.1B Chip manufacturing / Construction begins  in November 2025</span></strong></p><p></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">The construction and operation of the new Micron chip plant in Clay, NY, just minutes from the hotel.​ will significantly increase demand for local hotel rooms.​ This demand will be driven by thousands of construction workers requiring long-term accommodations, along with visiting experts and inspectors during the building phase.​ As the plant transitions to operational status, new employees will need temporary lodging during their training and onboarding periods.​ Additionally, the operational phase will bring a steady flow of business travelers, including suppliers, partners, and customers visiting the plant.​ This influx will sustain higher occupancy levels in local hotels, be </span><strong>Strong Market Fundamentals Driving Hotel Demand in Syracuse</strong></p><p>Syracuse is a high-demand lodging market with powerful institutional and leisure demand drivers:</p><ul><li>​<p><strong>Syracuse University</strong> (6 miles away) draws over 22,000 students and 4,600 faculty/staff from across the U.​S.​, consistently driving year-round room demand.​</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Upstate University Hospital & SUNY Medical Center</strong> (7 miles) employ over 9,500 and serve nearly 2 million people—an anchor for long-term healthcare-related stays.​</p></li><li>​<p><strong>St.​ Joseph’s Health & Crouse Hospital</strong> add another 6,000+ healthcare workers and significant patient/caregiver lodging demand.​</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Destiny USA</strong>, the largest mall in New York State, features 300+ stores and year-round entertainment, dining, and tourism appeal—fueling weekend and leisure stays.​</p></li><li>​<p><strong>St.​ Joseph’s Amphitheater at Lakeview</strong> (17,500-seat outdoor venue) brings major concert traffic and seasonal surges in overnight demand.​</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Micron Technology’s planned $6.1B chip plant</strong> just north of Syracuse is expected to create tens of thousands of jobs—transforming the local economy and driving long-term hotel and housing demand.​ and benefiting <span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">the local hospitality industry </span></p></li></ul>', 0.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'new-york-red-roof-brand-auto-transfer-absentee-owner', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/1927839/new-york-red-roof-brand-auto-transfer-absentee-owner', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/1927839/3c8f84b26d0b4149906b4c7f0f44a789_716x444.jpg', 18, 1, 0, 0, 0, '2025-05-15 14:01:20', '2025-10-01 23:57:16', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(228, 2098615, 'Rodeway Inn', 'Hospitality | 11.38% CAP | 53 Keys', '<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Exclusively offered by Dominic Henderson and Mitchell Glasson, Matthews Real Estate Investment Services™, the Rodeway Inn Baker City presents a compelling economy-segment hospitality investment with strong in-place cash flow, measurable upside potential, and a strategic location along Interstate 84.​</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br>The 53-key property is currently achieving a 11.38% cap rate based on 2024 performance, with revenue momentum projecting an 11.74% cap rate in 2025.​</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br>Baker City benefits from a diversified visitor base, including outdoor recreation enthusiasts, heritage tourists, and regional contractors.​ The market remains underserved in the hospitality sector, with the asset indexing at just 46.00% of its STR CompSet, providing significant opportunity for growth through targeted rate strategies and improved management practices.​</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br>Physically, the property is in strong operational condition with minimal PIP exposure, situated on a ±1.45-acre parcel and offering ±3,500 SF of meeting/restaurant space for additional revenue potential.​</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br>Tim Campbell<br>License No.​ 7901000087 (OR)<br>(866) 889-0550<br>Matthews Real Estate Investment Services, Inc<br>701 High Street,<br>#300, Eugene, OR 97401</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\"><br></span></p>', 2700000.00, 'On-Market', '[\"Hospitality\"]', '[]', 'oregon-rodeway-inn', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2098615/oregon-rodeway-inn', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2098615/cdc4a4713d694281924d903b73744420_716x444.jpg', 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-08 19:24:30', '2025-10-01 16:19:50', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
(230, 2227528, '17+ Acres Land For Sale', 'Zoned IG | Great I-5 Visibility', '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">For registration requirements and regulations, please review </span></strong><a href=\"https://learn.crexi.com/how-to-register-for-an-auction-crexi-help-center\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 82, 204, 1)\">here</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 255, 1)\"> </span><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">or contact </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-weight: 700\">Alexsis Wolfson | 949-799-4658 | aaguirre@crexi.​com.​</span></p><p>Discover a lucrative investment opportunity with Redwood Acres, a sprawling 17.7-acre parcel nestled between I-5 and Indian School Road NE in Salem, OR.​ Boasting a zoning classification of IG, this land is primed for warehousing, secondary processing, and more.​ A wetlands delineation has been completed, identifying approximately 3.7 acres of wetlands.​ The property provides exceptional visibility with daily traffic of 87,000 vehicles on I-5, making it an ideal location for businesses.​ Situated within proximity to a sizable population, with over 172,000 individuals residing within a 5-mile radius, this parcel offers lucrative potential.​ Demographic data from the 2010 US Census reveals a thriving community, with an average household income of $52,218 within a 5-mile range.​ Explore limitless opportunities for development at Redwood Acres.​ Don\'t miss your chance to secure this premier property in a strategic location.​ Visit our website for more information!</p><ul><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Non-Contingent</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Earnest Money Deposit: Greater of $20,000 or 10% of the Purchase Price</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>Marketing Fee: 5% of the Winning Bid Amount, $20,000 minimum</span></span></strong></li><li style=\"text-align: justify\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 1)\"><span>$10,000 Participation Deposit</span></span></strong></li></ul><p> Indian School Rd NE, Salem, OR 97305</p>', 500000.00, 'Auction', '[\"Land\"]', '[]', 'oregon-17-acres-land-for-sale', 'https://www.crexi.com/properties/2227528/oregon-17-acres-land-for-sale', 'https://images.crexi.com/assets/2227528/8ecf352ce0754526980f85e63df0d9f3_716x444.jpg', 33, 0, 1, 0, 0, '2025-10-28 14:37:46', '2025-11-24 20:24:11', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
