(23, 23, 'B6', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>The Investor should note that the unfinished apartment can either be updated and cleared for occupancy of at least $1200.00 a month. As a new owner you could turn the apartment into an additional office space. The current Tenant is a Bank with its loan department established here with a long term lease and its headquarters are in Guntersville, Alabama. </p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$850,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Office\",\"Sub Type\":\"Executive Office, Traditional Office\",\"Class\":\"A\",\"Lease Type\":\"NNN\",\"Tenant Credit\":\"Corporate Guarantee\",\"Tenancy\":\"Single\",\"Lease Term\":\"5 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"01\\/01\\/2023\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"01\\/02\\/2028\",\"Remaining Term\":\"3 years\",\"Square Footage\":\"4,100\",\"Net Rentable (SqFt)\":\"3,200\",\"Cap Rate\":\"7.00%\",\"Pro-Forma Cap Rate\":\"7.06%\",\"Occupancy\":\"1%\",\"NOI\":\"$60,000\",\"Pro-Forma NOI\":\"$60,000\",\"Units\":\"2\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2023\",\"Buildings\":\"1\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Zoning\":\"B6\",\"Lot Size (SqFt)\":\"3,174\",\"Parking (spaces)\":\"6\",\"Broker Co-Op\":\"Yes\",\"APN\":\"0304181028005.000\"}', '[\"Executive Office\",\"Traditional Office\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:51', '2025-12-16 11:07:51'),
