(33, 33, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.45, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Strategic High-Traffic Location: Positioned at 7171 Stockton Blvd, a heavily trafficked retail corridor with over 33,600 AADT on Florin Rd and over 25,600 AADT on Stockton Blvd.</p><p>Net Lease with Minimal Landlord Responsibilities: Tenant covers property taxes, insurance, and maintenance, with the landlord only responsible for foundation and structure, making this a low-maintenance investment.</p><p>Strong Long-Term Lease: 11 years remaining on the lease, with three 5-year renewal options and 10% rent increases every five years, ensuring growing cash flow.</p><p>Established 7-Eleven Brand: As a leading global convenience retailer, 7-Eleven operates over 83,000 stores worldwide, demonstrating a strong and stable tenant profile.</p><p>Thriving Sacramento Market: The city boasts a regional population of over 2.4 million, with continued residential and commercial expansion.</p><p>Surrounded by High-Density Retail: Adjacent to a Walmart Supercenter, along with major retailers such as Target, Home Depot, and Ross, positioning the property for consistent consumer activity.</p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$6,774,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Convenience Store, Gas Station, Storefront\",\"Investment Type\":\"Net Lease\",\"Lease Type\":\"NN+\",\"Tenancy\":\"Single\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"7-Eleven, Wawa, Sheetz\",\"Lease Term\":\"15.1 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"06\\/14\\/2021\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"06\\/29\\/2036\",\"Square Footage\":\"3,072\",\"Cap Rate\":\"5.15%\",\"NOI\":\"$348,832\",\"Year Built\":\"2021\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.45\",\"Rent Bumps\":\"Yes\",\"Broker Co-Op\":\"Yes\",\"Ground Lease\":\"No\",\"Sale Condition\":\"1031 exchange\"}', '[\"Convenience Store\",\"Gas Station\",\"Storefront\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:51', '2025-12-16 11:07:51'),
(34, 34, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1.36, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p>24-unit asset in the heart of University City in the St. Louis MSA</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Close proximity to the Delmar Loop entertainment and retail district</p></li><li>​<p>Short distance to renowned Washington University in St. Louis</p></li><li>​<p>Large unit sizes averaging 1,200 SF, well above the market average of 941 SF</p></li><li>​<p>Below market rents - $308/month in avg. rent upside</p></li><li>​<p>Ideal unit mix of (23) large 2 BDs and (1) 3 BD units – All 1,200+ SF</p></li><li>​<p>Value-add opportunities through further cosmetic upgrades or increasing in-place rents to market rate</p></li><li>​<p>Excellent access to Hwy 170 and Olive Boulevard; less than 13 minutes from Lambert</p></li><li>​<p>St. Louis International Airport and 20 minutes to downtown St. Louis</p></li><li>​<p>Located 2.4 miles from the Delmar Loop entertainment & retail district</p></li><li>​<p>The property is located 5.2 miles from BJC Healthcare, the #1 Best Hospital in Missouri (U.S. News & World Report, 2023)</p></li><li>​<p>Close proximity to the new Market and Olive development at the intersection of Olive Boulevard and I-170, which is anchored by Costco and Target </p></li><li>​<p>Nearby Olive Crossing, located at the southwest corner of Olive and I-70, a 14.8 acre development that will feature apartments, office space, hotel rooms, and 30,000 SF of retail.</p></li><li>​<p>Offered below replacement cost</p></li></ul>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$3,200,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Multifamily\",\"Sub Type\":\"Apartment Building\",\"Class\":\"B\",\"Square Footage\":\"28,800\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$111.11\",\"Units\":\"24\",\"Year Built\":\"1957\",\"Buildings\":\"6\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"1.36\"}', '[\"Apartment Building\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
