(60, 60, '3900-Hotel/Motel', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.41, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">NEW ROOF</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">. This Ranch Motel is a 12-unit with owners apartment establishment in Daytona Beach, near LPGA Boulevard, which leads to the Tanger Outlets. It is situated directly in front of the Daytona Pictona Field, attracting high traffic from tourists and players who appreciate the convenience of walking access. Guests at the motel can enjoy a good view and are within walking distance of the river, adding to the appeal of their stay in Daytona Beach. Close to the beaches with, bountiful fishing, beachside shops, waterfront restaurants, and State parks. Its laid-back atmosphere and retro vibe make it a popular destination for vacationers looking for a blend of relaxation and things to do This is a turn-key operation with several 5-star reviews on TripAdvisor. The motel is in a growing business area, with the YMCA located across the street and the Holly Hill Outpost directly opposite.OWC For more information call Terry Sitaram @ 386-237-4444</span></p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$1,151,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Hospitality, Multifamily, Senior Living\",\"Sub Type\":\"Motel\",\"Investment Type\":\"Redevelopment\",\"Investment Sub Type\":\"Hospitality\",\"Square Footage\":\"3,832\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$300.37\",\"Occupancy\":\"80%\",\"Occupancy Date\":\"08\\/07\\/2024\",\"Beds\":\"12\",\"Keys\":\"12\",\"Year Built\":\"1952\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2020\",\"Buildings\":\"1\",\"Stories\":\"1\",\"Zoning\":\"3900-Hotel\\/Motel\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.41\",\"Broker Co-Op\":\"Yes\",\"APN\":\"4242-62-05-0060\",\"Price\\/Key\":\"$95,916.67 \",\"Ground Lease\":\"No\",\"Ownership\":\"owned\"}', '[\"Motel\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
