(72, 72, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10.92, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><span><span>Matthews™ is pleased to present the exclusive offering of Huling RV Park, a 70-site RV community located in San Angelo, Texas. Positioned on ±10.92 acres, the property is being offered at $4,000,000, delivering a compelling 8.56% cap rate and immediate in-place cash flow.</span></span></p><p><span><span>The asset’s strategic position near Lake Nasworthy and the greater San Angelo market drives steady, year-round demand from both lifestyle renters and the local workforce. Proximity to outdoor amenities, retail, schools, and major employment nodes supports durable occupancy, while convenient access to key arterials enhances leasing velocity. Together, these advantages translate into stable operations and consistent revenue performance.</span></span></p><p><span><span>Arthur Varela, Chad Kurz, and Kevin Puder (In conjunction with Matthews Real Estate Investment Services, Inc., a cooperating foreign broker for this listing pursuant to Section 535.4(b) of the Texas Administrative Code)</span></span></p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$4,000,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Mobile Home Park\",\"Sub Type\":\"Mobile Home\",\"Cap Rate\":\"8.56%\",\"Units\":\"70\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"10.92\"}', '[]', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
(73, 73, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2.57, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Houston-based Third Coast Bancshares will acquire Austin, Texas-based Keystone Bank in a roughly $123 million deal set to close in the first quarter of 2026, the banks announced on October 22, 2025. Once the transaction is completed, the combined company will have pro forma total assets in excess of $6B.</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">2024 Construction. 22,662+/- SF Building on 2.57+/- Acre Site</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">New 12-Year Corporate NNN Lease w/ 2% Rental Increases Every Year, Plus (3) 5-Year Options to Renew</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Directly Across From Home Depot & Target Entrance Along RM 620 (30K VPD), 12 miles from Downtown Austin</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Near Lake Travis High School (3,666 students), Baylor Scott Medical (106 Beds), and The Galleria (210 Acres) w/ Whole Foods, Dick’s, </span><a href=\"H.E.B.\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">H.E.B.</span></a></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Near Two Huge Developments: The Village at Spanish Oaks (88 Acres) and The Backyard (35 Acres)</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Keystone Bank Is One of the Fastest Growing Banks in Texas, Currently Handling Over $1B in Assets</span></p></li><li>​<p><span style=\"color: rgba(51, 51, 51, 1)\">Bee Cave (Austin, TX) | Fastest Growing Town in the Lake Travis Area – 84% Increase Since 2010 | MSA Population: 2.23M+</span></p></li></ul>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$13,093,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Bank, Storefront\",\"Investment Type\":\"Net Lease\",\"Lease Type\":\"NNN\",\"Tenant Credit\":\"Corporate Guarantee\",\"Tenancy\":\"Single\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"Keystone Bank\",\"Lease Term\":\"12 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"12\\/01\\/2023\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"12\\/01\\/2035\",\"Remaining Term\":\"10 years\",\"Square Footage\":\"22,662\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$577.75\",\"Cap Rate\":\"6.60%\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"NOI\":\"$864,117\",\"Year Built\":\"2024\",\"Buildings\":\"1\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"2.57\",\"Rent Bumps\":\"2% Annually\",\"Lease Options\":\"(3) 5-Year Renewal Options\"}', '[\"Bank\",\"Storefront\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
