(77, 77, 'RR', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.40, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>Strategically located on Wall Street, just steps from one of Midland’s busiest intersections at W. Wall Street and S. Garfield Street, this property benefits from exceptional visibility and high traffic volume. Positioned along a heavily traveled corridor, thousands of vehicles pass by daily, making it an ideal spot for businesses seeking maximum exposure.</p><p><em>Listed Lease Price: $6,000/month NNN</em> </p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$650,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Storefront\",\"Tenancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Square Footage\":\"6,500\",\"Year Built\":\"1961\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2021\",\"Zoning\":\"RR\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.4\"}', '[\"Storefront\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:52', '2025-12-16 11:07:52'),
