(148, 148, 'C3', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p>Specialized Facility – Healthcare Real Estate holds a strong track record of long-term tenancy due to high-cost buildouts, such as with the subject property’s surgery center.</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Hospital Adjacent – Seven hospital campuses are within one mile of the subject property, totaling a staggering 4,857 beds.</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Income Tax Free State – Texas is one of the nine states with zero state income tax.</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>High Population Density – Nearly 370,000 residents live within a 5-mile radius of the subject property.</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Easy Access. Located at a major, signalized intersection, this facility is easily and conveniently accessible.</p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p>Retail Centric – Numerous shopping malls and retail outlets surround the subject property, including national tenants such as Starbucks, Chick-fil-A, Wells Fargo, and The Home Depot</p></li></ul>', '{\"Starting Bid\":\"$200,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Office\",\"Sub Type\":\"Medical Office\",\"Investment Type\":\"Owner\\/User\",\"Class\":\"B\",\"Tenancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Square Footage\":\"3,896\",\"Occupancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Units\":\"4\",\"Year Built\":\"1983\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2021\",\"Buildings\":\"1\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Zoning\":\"C3\",\"APN\":\"11608-100-0807\",\"Ground Lease\":\"No\",\"Ownership\":\"Condo\"}', '[\"Medical Office\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(149, 149, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong><u>Value-Add Potential</u></strong></p><p>The Boerne Villa offers investors a rare opportunity to acquire a fully stabilized, cash-flowing asset from day one, with substantial value-add potential. Currently at 100% occupancy, the property provides immediate income while also presenting an upside through strategic enhancements. By updating the interiors and improving the exterior for greater curb appeal and visibility, investors can raise rents and further increase the property’s value. This blend of strong, stable cash flow and significant growth potential makes Boerne Villa a standout investment opportunity in the market.</p><p><strong><u>Growing Kendall County</u></strong></p><p>Boerne, the county seat of Kendall county, is a city on the rise with explosive population growth over the past few years. Since 2020 the population has grown by 27% with an annual rate of 5.65%. It’s appeal as a desirable place to live has attracted a steady influx of new residents with it’s high quality of life, picturesque scenery, and outdoor recreation opportunities. Dubbed the “Hub of the Hill Country,” Boerne is less than 15 miles from San Antonio and a short drive to other charming Hill Country communities like Comfort, Bandera, Johnson City, Kerrville, Fredericksburg, New Braunfels, and San Marcos.</p><p><strong><u>Prime, Central Location</u></strong></p><p>Conveniently located less than a mile from Boerne City Hall and Boerne ISD Administration Center, Boerne Villas sits right off the main thoroughfare of East Blanco Road. Tenants can enjoy walking to local popular destinations like the famous Mary’s Tacos, River Road Park, Cibolo Creek Brewing Co., Free Roam Brewing Company, Black Rifle Coffee, Hungry Horse Restaurant, Richter Tavern, The Dienger Trading Co., and many other eateries/attractions.</p>', '{\"Property Type\":\"Multifamily\",\"Sub Type\":\"Apartment Building\",\"Investment Type\":\"Value Add\",\"Class\":\"C\",\"Net Rentable (SqFt)\":\"14,464\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"Units\":\"16\",\"Year Built\":\"1970\",\"Buildings\":\"2\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.89\"}', '[\"Apartment Building\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(150, 150, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 14.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p>• Opportunity to own 39 luxury condominiums within a larger 64 unit development</p><p>• 2010 construction</p><p>• Located in a highly sought-after submarket of St. Louis South County</p><p>• Proven value-add program on light renovations</p><p>• Large units averaging 1,200 SF</p><p>• Excellent access to Hwy. 55; less than thirty minutes from Lambert St. Louis International Airport and 20 minutes to downtown St. Louis</p><p>• Located 16.2 miles from Busch Stadium</p><p>• Offered below replacement cost</p>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$5,700,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Multifamily\",\"Sub Type\":\"Apartment Building\",\"Class\":\"B\",\"Square Footage\":\"37,986\",\"Units\":\"39\",\"Year Built\":\"2010\",\"Buildings\":\"2\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"14.75\"}', '[\"Apartment Building\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
