(169, 169, 'City Business', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.76, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p><strong>WA Auctioneer: Auction Company License: Crexi, WA 24004486</strong></p><ul><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Prime Location</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Strategically positioned at 604 Central Avenue South, Quincy, WA 98848, this prominent corner site sits at the entrance to downtown and offers direct access to State Routes 28 and 281, with nearby connectivity to Interstate 90. The property comprises two adjoining commercial parcels, presenting a rare opportunity for future development in a high-visibility, high-traffic location.</span></p></li></ul><ul><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Growing Fortune 500 Tech Hub: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Quincy has established itself as a rapidly growing technology corridor, with significant investment from Fortune 500 firms, including Microsoft. The expanding presence of global tech leaders is catalyzing demand for well-located commercial properties to support data infrastructure and related services.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Proximity to Data Centers</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Located near facilities operated by Microsoft, Sabey, H5, CyrusOne, Yahoo, Vantage, and NTT Data, the site benefits from adjacency to one of the Pacific Northwest’s leading data center clusters. This proximity supports future demand from tech-aligned users and service providers seeking access to reliable infrastructure.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Renewable Energy Advantage</span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">: Quincy leverages hydroelectric power from the nearby Columbia River, providing tenants with access to low-cost, sustainable energy. This green energy advantage enhances appeal to environmentally conscious occupiers and supports ESG-aligned investment strategies.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Economic Growth Trajectory: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">The local economy continues to expand across multiple sectors, including agriculture, advanced manufacturing, and information technology. This economic momentum contributes to long-term stability and enhances the site’s value proposition for investors targeting growth markets.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Infrastructure and Amenities: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Encompassing approximately ±0.76 acres, the site offers excellent frontage at the region’s busiest intersection—State Route 28 and State Route 281. With ample space for vertical development, it presents a compelling opportunity for a variety of retail, office, or service-oriented uses.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Supportive Business Environment: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Quincy is recognized for its efficient permitting process and pro-business governance, which can significantly reduce entitlement timelines and regulatory risk. This investor-friendly environment positions the site for streamlined development execution.</span></p></li><li>​<p><strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Community Impact: </span></strong><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)\">Positioned at the “Main & Main” of Quincy, these parcels serve as a key downtown gateway, offering a highly visible platform for projects that drive job creation, support entrepreneurship, and contribute to regional economic development.</span></p></li></ul>', '{\"Starting Bid\":\"$250,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Gas Station\",\"Tenancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Square Footage\":\"6,568\",\"Occupancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Year Built\":\"1956\",\"Stories\":\"1\",\"Zoning\":\"City Business\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.76\",\"APN\":\"31-1191-000 & 31-1190-000\"}', '[\"Gas Station\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(170, 170, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2.57, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p>Cadence Education is one of the largest private childcare providers in the United States, with 30+ years of operating history and 300+ locations.</p></li><li>​<p>12+ years remaining on a Triple Net (NNN) Lease with 2% annual escalators, providing a long-term and passive investment opportunity with a strong hedge against inflation.</p></li><li>​<p>Outstanding demographics — this property is located in a high-growth and affluent market with 170,556 residents making an average household income of $119,752 within a 5-mile radius of the property.</p></li><li>​<p>The immediate trade area is expected to experience a 28% increase in population through 2029 within a 3-mile radius of the property.</p></li><li>​<p>Conveniently located along Limmer Loop with close proximity to feeder elementary schools: Veterans Hill Elementary, Kerley Elementary, and Linda Herrington Elementary.</p></li><li>​<p>Round Rock, TX (Austin, TX MSA) has been nationally recognized as home to Dell\'s world headquarters and is considered a leader in economic development in Central Texas. The city is also known for its young and educated workforce, with over 41% of residents having a bachelor\'s degree or higher. </p></li><li>​<p>Texas is an income tax-free state.</p></li></ul>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$7,022,688\",\"Property Type\":\"Special Purpose\",\"Sub Type\":\"School\",\"Investment Type\":\"Net Lease\",\"Lease Type\":\"NNN\",\"Tenant Credit\":\"Corporate Guarantee\",\"Tenancy\":\"Single\",\"Lease Term\":\"15.1 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"07\\/29\\/2022\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"08\\/31\\/2037\",\"Remaining Term\":\"11.8 years\",\"Square Footage\":\"12,821\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$547.75\",\"Cap Rate\":\"6.38%\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"NOI\":\"$447,697\",\"Year Built\":\"1980\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2022\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"2.57\",\"Rent Bumps\":\"2% Annually\",\"Lease Options\":\"2 x 5 Year Options\"}', '[\"School\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
(171, 171, 'Flexible', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.14, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​Eight dedicated parking spaces</li><li>​Centrally located mixed-use property</li><li>​Minutes from from everywhere \"Palm Beacher\" wants to be</li><li>​Located in the heart of Palm Beach</li><li>​Property blends urban energy with coastal cool</li></ul>', '{\"Starting Bid\":\"$150,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Mixed Use\",\"Tenancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Square Footage\":\"3,181\",\"Occupancy\":\"Vacant\",\"Year Built\":\"1940\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2021\",\"Buildings\":\"2\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Zoning\":\"Flexible\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.14\",\"Parking (spaces)\":\"8\",\"APN\":\"74-43-43-16-01-008-0050\"}', '[]', '2025-12-16 11:07:53', '2025-12-16 11:07:53'),
