(202, 202, 'CO', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ol><li>​<p><strong>Price Improvement</strong></p></li><li>​<p><strong>Seller Financing Available:</strong> Owner will consider <strong>seller carry</strong> for qualified buyers—capital-efficient entry and faster closing (subject to price/terms/credit).</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Prime McAllen Location:</strong> Steps from <strong>La Plaza Mall</strong>; minutes to <strong>Downtown McAllen</strong>, airport, medical, and cross-border corridors.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>49 Keys | Wyndham Flag:</strong> Recognized economy brand with national distribution, loyalty capture, and low operating complexity.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Durable Demand Base:</strong> Year-round mix of <strong>leisure, medical, value-oriented corporate, and cross-border</strong> travelers.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Operational Upside:</strong> Targeted <strong>room refresh</strong>, revenue management, and direct-booking strategies to expand margin and RevPAR.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Cost Efficiencies:</strong> Compact footprint supports lean staffing, controllable utilities, and simplified maintenance.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Sales & Channel Levers:</strong> Local corporate/contract rates, crew business, and OTA mix optimization for near-term lift.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Replace-to-New Advantage:</strong> Attractive basis versus new construction in a high-traffic retail/service corridor.</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Tour/Tenant Protection:</strong> Strict <strong>Do Not Disturb</strong>; all inquiries and tours coordinated exclusively through <strong>Avison Young</strong>.</p></li></ol>', '{\"Property Type\":\"Hospitality\",\"Sub Type\":\"Hotel\",\"Investment Type\":\"Stabilized\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"Super 8 Motel, Wyndham hotels\",\"Square Footage\":\"34,848\",\"Keys\":\"49\",\"Year Built\":\"1985\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2024\",\"Stories\":\"2\",\"Zoning\":\"CO\",\"Parking (spaces)