(203, 203, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2.00, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ol><li>​<p><strong>True NNN Leases</strong> with zero landlord responsibilities—tenants handle all maintenance, taxes, and insurance</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Strong, experienced operators</strong> backed by personal guarantees and proven multi-unit track records</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Significant tenant capital investment</strong> (hundreds of thousands each) into custom build-outs, ensuring long-term commitment</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Built-in rental growth</strong>: 3% annual bumps for All American Gymnastics through 2032; 2.5% annual bumps for Steps to Success through 2037 plus two 5-year options</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Weighted Average Lease Term (WALT) of ~9 years</strong> remaining</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Prime 2-acre corner lot</strong> with 69 parking spaces and outstanding visibility: 34,000 VPD on Merrick Rd, 30,000 VPD on Ocean Ave, and 46,000 VPD on Sunrise Highway</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Dense, affluent trade area</strong>: Over 2 million residents within 10 miles; average household incomes exceeding $152,000 (3-mile) and $140,000 (5-mile)</p></li><li>​<p><strong>Strategic Nassau County location</strong> just 24 miles from Manhattan and minutes from JFK International Airport</p></li></ol>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$8,444,275\",\"Property Type\":\"Industrial, Mixed Use, Office, Retail, Special Purpose\",\"Sub Type\":\"Flex, School, Warehouse\",\"Investment Type\":\"Net Lease\",\"Lease Type\":\"NNN\",\"Tenant Credit\":\"Credit Rated, Corporate Guarantee\",\"Tenancy\":\"Multi\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"Steps to Success, All American Gymnastics\",\"Lease Term\":\"15 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"07\\/01\\/2022\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"06\\/30\\/2037\",\"Remaining Term\":\"11.6 years\",\"Square Footage\":\"28,000\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$301.58\",\"Cap Rate\":\"8.00%\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"NOI\":\"$675,542\",\"Units\":\"2\",\"Lot Size