(223, 223, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p>Shadow Anchored By Top Performing Kroger Location (NAP): This Kroger Performs in the Top 4% of All Grocery Stores Nationwide (Placer.ai) With 1.3M Visits Per Year Creating a Strong Destination Location and Customer Draw</p></li><li>​<p>100% Leased Shopping Center Featuring 6 Tenants, Including Casual Dining, Healthcare, and Other Essential Services; The Variety of Business Types Ensures a Steady Income Stream and Broad Customer Appeal, Making this a Strong and Stable Investment</p></li><li>​<p>High Yield (8.55% Cap Rate) and Low Cost Per Square Foot Opportunity ($170 PSF)</p></li><li>​<p>Below Market Rents (Average $16.08) Providing Future Security / Potential Upside to a New Investor</p></li><li>​<p>Long-Term Operating History / Low Historical Vacancy - 4 of the 6 Tenants Have Operated at the Property For Over 15 Years</p></li><li>​<p>Long Term Leasehold (66 Years Remaining With Options) Provides New Investors with Full Depreciation</p></li><li>​<p>Affluent Trade Area - Over $95,014 Average Household Income Within a 5-Mile Radius</p></li><li>​<p>Densely Populated Area - Over 147,000 Residents Residing Within a 5-Mile Radius Contributing to the Shopping Center\'s Sustained Success</p></li><li>​<p>Strong Retail Corridor With Neighboring Tenants Including - Kroger, Chipotle, McDonald\'s, Sonic Drive-In, Secure EZ Storage, Domino\'s Pizza, and More</p></li></ul>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$2,350,000\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Storefront, Shopping Center\",\"Tenancy\":\"Multi\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"Little Caesars, Leftys Tobacco Plus, Hi-Tek Nails, RentMart, CareFirst Urgent Care, Skyline Chili\",\"Number of Tenants\":\"6\",\"Cap Rate\":\"8.55%\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"NOI\":\"$200,841\"}', '[\"Storefront\",\"Shopping Center\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54'),
