(247, 247, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0.98, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<ul><li>​<p><span><span>Absolute NNN Lease: This property operates under a completely passive lease structure, imposing zero landlord management obligations. The tenant is fully responsible for all maintenance, operating expenses, real estate taxes, and insurance.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Traffic Count: Shallowford Road sees over 28,000 VPD making this an optimal location for a Gas Station / C-Store</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Operating History: The presence of Circle K at this location since 2003 signifies strong, proven site performance and the tenant’s long-term commitment to the trade area.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Brand Recognition: The investment is backed by the stability of Circle K, a premier global convenience store operator with a presence in 48 states and a national ranking of 2nd, overseeing approximately 15,000 locations worldwide.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Growing Population: The local market is poised for continued expansion, with Chattanooga’s population increasing steadily since 2020, positioning it among Tennessee’s fastest-growing counties.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Retail Synergy: The site benefits from its position within a dense commercial corridor, surrounded by major national retail anchors and dealerships, including Chevrolet, Nissan, Acura, Jeep, Waffle House, and Coca-Cola, ensuring high consumer traffic.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>High Visibility: The property enjoys prime exposure on a high-traffic main road and features direct accessibility due to its immediate proximity to I-75 and Gunbarrel Road.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Bonus Depreciation: This investment may qualify for 100% Bonus Depreciation, offering a significant opportunity for tax optimization. Investors should consult with a Certified Public Accountant (CPA) to confirm eligibility.</span></span></p></li><li>​<p><span><span>Tennessee Real Estate: Investing in Tennessee provides a distinct advantage as a tax-friendly state, making it exceptionally appealing for individuals and businesses focused on maximizing investment returns.</span></span></p></li></ul>', '{\"Asking Price\":\"$2,073,584\",\"Property Type\":\"Retail\",\"Sub Type\":\"Convenience Store, Gas Station, Storefront\",\"Lease Type\":\"Absolute NNN\",\"Tenant Credit\":\"Corporate Guarantee\",\"Tenancy\":\"Single\",\"Brand\\/Tenant\":\"7-Eleven, Wawa, Circle K, QuikTrip, Shell, Chevron, 76 Gas, Exxon Mobile\",\"Lease Term\":\"25.1 years\",\"Lease Commencement\":\"10\\/16\\/2003\",\"Lease Expiration\":\"10\\/31\\/2028\",\"Remaining Term\":\"2.9 years\",\"Square Footage\":\"2,640\",\"Price per SqFt\":\"$785.45\",\"Cap Rate\":\"6.50%\",\"Occupancy\":\"100%\",\"NOI\":\"$134,783\",\"Year Built\":\"1989\",\"Year Renovated\":\"2021\",\"Buildings\":\"1\",\"Stories\":\"1\",\"Lot Size (acres)\":\"0.98\",\"Lease Options\":\"5,5 Year Options\",\"Ownership\":\"Fee Simple\"}', '[\"Convenience Store\",\"Gas Station\",\"Storefront\"]', '2025-12-16 11:07:54', '2025-12-16 11:07:54');
